<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ADIISƐM</para>
  <para style="toc3">Adi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Adiisɛm</para>
  <para style="toc1">ADIISƐM</para>
  <para style="mt4">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ADIISƐM<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyekyire.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu Kristo yeɛ ɔyele edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Adiisɛm nwomaa nanu ne hyirele Yohane ɔ, na ɔmaa onwuni nningyein bɔ ɔbaasisi ne. Yohane bɔ ɔhworɔle Adiisɛm nwomaa ne, ye yeɛ ole suaniɛ bɔ né Yesu dɔ ye paa ne, na ye ala yeɛ ɔhworɔle <char style="bd">Yohane Nzɛmba</char>, <char style="bd">1 Yohane</char>, <char style="bd">2 Yohane</char>, ɔne <char style="bd">3 Yohane</char> ne. Adiisɛm nwomaa ne de, ɔhworɔle ne, né bapɛ ye asue bahɔ Patmo supɔ naso wɔ afoɛ 98 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> nu berɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">“Adiisɛm” fi Greek dwirɛ <char style="tl">Apokalupsis</char> nu, na bɔ okyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, “ebie ye nikye bie ali kyire ebie” anaakyɛ “obukye nikye bie so kyire ye.” Yeti wɔ Adiisɛm nwomaa nanu ne, né Yesu bukye nningyein biemɔ so kyire Yohane—nningyein bɔ ne okosisi wɔ awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Adiisɛm nwomaa ne ahyɛaseɛ ne, Yesu maa Yohane hworɔle ngrataa mane asafo nzoo bɔ né ɔwɔ Asia ne, sɔ asafo nemɔ yeɛ ole <char style="bd">Efeso</char>, <char style="bd">Smirna</char>, <char style="bd">Pergamo</char>, <char style="bd">Tiatira</char>, <char style="bd">Sardi</char>, <char style="bd">Filadefia</char>, ne <char style="bd">Laodikea</char>. Yohane limoa bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ, otuli bɛ fo, yeɛ ɔhyɛle bɛ ngunaen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛhene si ne, Yohane nwuni anisoadehu bɔ ɔfa nningyein bɔ okosisi kyẽabie nanwo. Sɔ anisoadehu ne bie yeɛ ole:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Mbɔngɔ nná ne bɛ bɔ bɛtete bɛ so ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Abɔfo nná bɔ bɛtire-tira aseɛ so mvrama nna nanu ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Abɔfo nzoo bɔ ne bɛtira awɛen nzoo ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Anisoadehu bɔ ɔfa Nyameɛ adanzefoɛ nyɔ nanwo ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ngondii bɔ ɔkɔhɔ so wɔ Yesu ne y'abɔfo ne Satan ne y'abɔfo afia ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ngaka suronyi-suronyi nyɔ ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Boan Ba ne né mmenia 144,000 ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Mmeni lɔen kandinga bɔ bɛtire-tira ɛberɛ ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtira ngyɛnzee bɔ Nyameɛ ɛyaa wɔ nu ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Amagedon koɛ ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Tuutuuniɛ bɔ ɔte kaka kɔkorɛ suronyi-suronyi bie so ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kyɛbɔ Yesu ne ye abɔfo nemɔ sɛkyele abɔnefoɛ;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yeɛ afei kyɛbɔ bɛkɔhye Satan bɛkɔto prizin, tumi bɔ Yesu koli ye afoɛ 1,000, ɔne mmenia bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ bɛkofi ewue nu ne.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Adiisɛm nwomaa ne né Genesis nwomaa ne bɔ abusua; Genesis nwomaa ne maa yɛnwu bɔ yeti yeɛ sona asetena yɛle basaa, yeɛ Adiisɛm nwomaa ne maa yɛnwu atee bɔ Nyameɛ kɔfa so kɔmaa mmenia kosa konya asetena pa bieku.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="io1">Krataa ne ahyɛaseɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Asafo nzoo né ngrataa ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:9-3:22">1:9–3:22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nwomaa bɔ bafa stamp nzoo bahyɛ ye nzorɛ ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 4:1-8:1">4:1–8:1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Awɛen nzoo ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 8:2-11:19">8:2–11:19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛwoo kandinga suronyi-suronyi ne, ɔne ngaka nyɔ ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 2:1-13:18">2:1–13:18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anisoadehu foforɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 14:1-15:8">14:1–15:8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyɛnzee bɔ Nyameɛ ɛyaa wɔ nu ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 16:1-21">16:1-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmerɛ bɔ bɛkɔsɛkye Babilon kandinga ne, kaka suronyi-suronyi ne, ngondombo diifoɛ ne, ɔne Abɔnzam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 17:1-20:10">17:1–20:10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Atemmuo bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 20:11-15">20:11-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anwuro foforɛ, aseɛ foforɛ, ne Yerusalem foforɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21:1-22:5">21:1–22:5</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 22:6-21">22:6-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Yesu Kristo adiisɛm; Nyameɛ fa mane ye kyɛ ɔma ye ngoaa nwu nningyein bɔ ɔngɔhyɛ okosisi ne. Na ɔsomane ye abɔfo maa ɔfa mane ye akoaa Yohane. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Ye yeɛ olili nikye biala nwo adanzeɛ ne; olili edwirɛ bɔ Nyameɛ fa mane, ɔne adanzeɛ bɔ Yesu Kristo fa mane nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> yeɛ ole sona bɔ ɔkenga ngɔmhyɛ he anu dwirɛ ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔkenga ngɔmhyɛ he anu dwirɛ ne serɛ.”</char></note> ɔne bɛ bɔ betie, ná bɛfa bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ ngɔmhyɛ nanu ne bɛyɛ adwuma ne, ofikyɛ waha kaa bie né mmerɛ bɔ bahyɛ ne aso.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Me Yohane, mefa krataa he mekɔma asafo nzoo bɔ ɔwɔ Asia mandam nanu ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi Bɔ né ɔwɔ berɛ, ná ɔtɛ́ wɔ berɛ, na ɔba ne, ɔne honhom nzoo bɔ bɛgyigyi ye bia né nyunu ne, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />yeɛ Yesu Kristo, Danzeniɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ bɔ bali moa batingye ye bafi awufo nu, ná odi aseɛ aso ahemvo so ne berɛ ha ɛmɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Ye yeɛ ɔdɔ yɛ, ná ɔnate ye mogya naso alɛ́ yɛ koraa afi yɛ bɔne nu ne, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />na wayɛ yɛ ahemman ne asɔfo wama ye Nyameɛ ne ye Baba ne, amba, ye yeɛ anuonyam ne tumi ha ye daa. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Nea, ɔnate munungum nu ɔba, na anyeɛ mukoraati konwu ye, bɛ bɔ bɛfale nikye bɛwɔle ye ne po konwu ye. Na ye ti aseɛ so mmusua mukoraati koli aworaborɛ. Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ ɔ! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Awurade Nyameɛ nwa: “Me yeɛ nne Alfa ne Omega, Otumvoɛ bɔ ne ɔwɔ berɛ, na ɔtɛ́ wɔ berɛ, ná ɔba ne.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Me, ɛmɔ aliema Yohane, bɔ ɔnate adamvoa bɔ yɛne Yesu afa nati, yɛ mukoraati yanya kyɛfa wɔ amanehunu, ahennie, ne animia nu ne. Nyameɛ dwirɛ bɔ ngane, ɔne Yesu nwo adanzeɛ bɔ nnili nati, bɛfale me bɛhɔle Patmo supɔ naso. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mmale Awurade kyẽa nanu wɔ honhom nu, na ndele konviɛ kandinga bie te kyɛ awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> wɔ me si <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />kyɛ: “Bɔ enwu ye ne, tworɔ gua nwomaa bɔ babobɔ nu na fa kɔma asafo nzoo he: Efeso, Smirna, Pergamo, Tiatira, Sardi, Filadefia ne Laodikea.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Na ngyakyile me nwo kyɛ menea bɔ ɔne me dwudwo ne, mmerɛ bɔ ngyakyile me nwo ne, nwuni kanea mmakaa nzoo bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ bayɛ, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />né ebie bɔ wayɛ kyɛ Sona Awa ne gyi kanea mmakaa n'afia na atadeɛ bɔ owura ye ne, né ogua ye gya bo, yeɛ wafa sikaa kɔkorɛ abɔsoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛlɛt.”</char></note> wabɔ ye afia. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Afei koso, né ye ti nwiaa ayɛ te kyɛ gyese, né wayɛ fufue hyɛnn te kyɛ asukɔtwea, na ne ye nye mmaa ayɛ te kyɛ see bɔ ɔsɔ ne; <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />né ye gya ne ayɛ kyɛ kɔɔbere bɔ wasɔ kɔɔ wɔ fonoo nu ne, na ne ye konvi ayɛ te kyɛ nzue pee bɔ obu fa so ne. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Né nzramaa nzoo wɔ ye sa nu, ná dadeɛ tendee naen-naen, bɔ ye nyunu ne ye si mukoraati pɛ fili ye noa nu fitele, na né ye nyunu ata hyireinn te kyɛ eyia bɔ wata paa ne.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Nwuni ye nyunu ne, mbɛ nvini ye gya bo te kyɛ ebie bɔ wawu ne. Ná ɔfale ye sa famaa tole me so hane kyɛ: “Nnɛsuro. Me yeɛ nne bɔ oli moa ne bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />na me yeɛ nne bɔ ɔte ase ne; nwuli, nakoso nea, nde ase daa, na ndira Ewue ne Asieleɛ nzafoa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Yeti, tworɔ bɔ ɛnwuni ye, bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ, ne bɔ yesi ne okosisi ne. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Na nzramaa nzoo bɔ ɛnwuni ye wɔ me sa famaa nanu, ɔne kanea mmakaa nzoo ne de, ye nwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ɛhe: Nzramaa nzoo ne te asafo nzoo nemɔ abɔfo, na kanea mmakaa nzoo ne te asafo nzoo ne.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Tworɔ kɔma Efeso asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:1">Ɛhe yeɛ bɔ otira nzramaa nzoo wɔ ye sa famaa nu, na ɔnate kanea mmakaa nzoo bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ bayɛ né afia ne ka ɔ:<verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />‘Mese w'adwuma, wɔ fɛɛ, ne wɔ animia. Na mese kyɛ, ɛnzosɔ nnipa-bɔnefoɛ so, na bɛ bɔ bɛhane kyɛ bɛte asomafoɛ, nakoso ne ɔtte nahorɛ ne, ɛsɔle bɛ neane na ɛnwuni kyɛ bɛte ngondombofoɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Afei koso, emia wɔ nye gyina nu, na me dumaa ti, etɛ́ nwu amaneɛ bɔ w'abanu bulli ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Nakoso nne nikye bie metia wɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔdɔ bɔ né ɛle ye fɛɛse ne, amaa wate wahɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Yeti kaye nekaa bɔ ɛfini ase ne, na sakra yɛ nningyein bɔ fɛɛse ne, né ɛyɛ ne. Sɛ anyɛ sɔ a, ngɔwa wɔ berɛ ngɔɔye wɔ kanea bakaa ne ngofi nekaa bɔ ogyi ne, sana ɛsakra kora. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Nakoso nikye pa bie wɔ wɔ nwo, yeɛ ole kyɛ ɛkyi Nikolaifoɛ kue né nneyɛɛ kɔkɔ-kɔkɔ, kyɛbɔ me koso mekyi nala.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne. Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, ngɔmaa okoli ngoa bakaa bɔ ogyi Nyameɛ paradise berɛ ne bie.’<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Tworɔ kɔma Smirna asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:8">‘Ɛhe yeɛ bɔ “oli moa ná ɔpɛ yebo,” bɔ owuli na osa wale ngoa nu ne ka ɔ:<verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mese wɔ amanehunu ne wɔ hiaa, nakoso ɛte sikaniɛ paa. Na mese mmusue dwirɛ bɔ bɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ bɛ nwo Yudafoɛ ne ka ne. Nakoso bɛtte Yudafoɛ, mmom bɛta Satan si. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Nnɛsuro amaneɛ bɔ ɛbaanwu ye ne. Tie, Abɔnzam kɔfa ɛmɔ nu biemɔ kogua prizin, kyɛ ɔfa sɔ ɛmɔ nea, na ɛmɔ konwu amaneɛ ngyẽa buru. Nakoso kɔ so di nahorɛ kodwu ewue nu, na ngɔma wɔ ngoa abotire.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne. Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, ewue bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne nngɔyɛ ye hwee.’<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Tworɔ kɔma Pergamo asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:12">Ɛhe yeɛ bɔ ole dadeɛ naen-naen bɔ ye nyunu ne ye si pɛ ne ka ɔ:<verse eid="REV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />‘Mese nekaa bɔ ɛte ɔ, nekaa bɔ ɛte ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ Satan bia gyi ɔ; nakoso etɛ́ tira me dumaa nanu. Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛhuni Antipa bɔ ɔte m'adanzeniɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ ne wɔ wɔ nwo berɛ, nekaa bɔ Satan te ne po ne, anyakyi gyidie bɔ ɛle ye wɔ me nu nanu. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Nakoso, nne wɔ nwo dwirɛ kaa, yeɛ ole kyɛ: Mmenia biemɔ wɔ wɔ nu bɔ betɛ́ tira Balaam ngyerɛkyerɛ nu; Balaam he yeɛ ɔmaa Balak tole Israel mmaa nemɔ sintidua maa bɛlili nningyein bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen, na bɛbɔle adwaman ne. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Afei koso, ebiemɔ wɔ wɔ nu bɔ basɔ Nikolai kue né ngyerɛkyerɛ nu ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Yeti sakra; sɛ anzakra a, ngɔwa wɔ berɛ ndɛ, na dadeɛ tendee bɔ ofi me noa nu ne, ɛhene yeɛ mene bɛ kɔfa kɔhõ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne. Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, ngɔma ye mana bɔ wafea ne bie, na ngosa ngɔma ye nyɔboɛ fufue bie. Sɔ nyɔboɛ ne, bahworɔ dumaa bie bagua ye nwo, na ebiala nze sɔ dumaa ne, sana bɔ okole ne ngome.’<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Tworɔ kɔma Tiatira asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 2:18">Ɛhe yeɛ Nyameɛ Awa bɔ ye nye mmaa te kyɛ see bɔ ɔsɔ, na ye gya nwo te kyɛ kɔɔbere bɔ bahwi ye nwo ne ka ɔ:<verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />‘Mese wɔ adwuma, wɔ dɔ, wɔ gyidie, ne wɔ animia, na adwuma bɔ ɛyɛ ye ɛlɛsaen ne, ɔsone tra bɔ eli moa yɛle ne. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Nakoso, wɔ nwo dwirɛ bɔ nne ye yeɛ ole kyɛ: Ɛsosɔ sɔ brasua Jezebel, bɔ ɔfrɛ ye nwo diifoɛ naso. Sɔ brasua ne fa ye ngyerɛkyerɛ laka-laka me ngoaa maa bɛbɔ adwaman, na ɔmaa bɛdi aleɛ bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ɔwɔ nu, mmane ye mmerɛ kyɛ ɔsakra, nakoso ɔyɛlle ye adwene kyɛ ɔsakra fi ye adwaman nanwo. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Nea, mebaagyi ye meto anwonyerɛ mba so, na bɛ bɔ bɛne ye sɛkye agyaa ne, ngɔmaa bekonwu amaneɛ paa, sana basakra bafi bɛ nneyɛɛ nwo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Na ngohu ye mmaa mɔ maa asafo nemɔ konwu kyɛ, me yeɛ meneɛnea sona adwene ne ahone nu ne, na kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ nu biala nneyɛɛ te ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ngotua ye kerɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ aha wɔ Tiatira, bɔ ɛmɔnni sɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ he si, ná ɛmɔ anzua bɔ bɛfrɛ ye “Satan nningyein bɔ enu yɛ se” ne, bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ: Mengɔfa adesoa foforɛ biala mengɔto ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Yeti bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne, ɛmɔtira nu yé ma oodwu kyɛ ngɔwa ne. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Na bɔ okoli ngunim, na okoli me dwirɛ so koodwu awieɛ ne, ngɔma ye tumi wɔ maen-maen naso, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />na ɔkɔfa buralɛ pɔmaa koli mmenia naso, ná wabubu bɛ pasaa te kyɛ ngukue, kyɛbɔ me koso nyane tumi mvili me Baba berɛ nala. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Na ngɔfa ngyerɛmɔ nzramaa ngɔma ye.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne.’ ”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Tworɔ kɔma Sardi asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:1">Bɔ ole Nyameɛ honhom nzoo ne nzramaa nzoo ne nwa nyoo:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:1">‘Mese wɔ adwuma; alɛ́ dumaa kyɛ ɛte ase, nakoso awu. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Ma wɔ nye la berɛ; ná bɔ waha bɔ ahaa owu ne, maa enu yɛ se. Ofikyɛ menwu ye kyɛ, me Nyameɛ nye so de, ɛyielle w'adwuma ne. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Yeti, kaye bɔ enyane ye na ɛtele ne; di so na sakra. Sɛ andingye a, ngɔwa kyɛ awieniɛ, na ɛngonwu mmerɛ bɔ ngɔwa wɔ so ne po. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Nakoso ɛle mmenia kaa wɔ Sardi bɔ bɛ de bɛyɛlle b'atadeɛ nanu fiɛ, na ɔnate kyɛ bɛfata nati, bɛkowura ndadeɛ fufue na bɛne me anate. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, bɛkowura ye atadeɛ fufue, na mengɔkyikyi ye dumaa mengofi ngoa nwomaa nanu, mmom ngɔbɔ ye dumaa wɔ me Baba ne ye abɔfo nemɔ nyunu.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne.’<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Tworɔ kɔma Filadefia asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:7">‘Bɔ ɔte krongron na odi nahorɛ, bɔ otira David nzafoa, na obukye a ebie ngora ndonu, ná oto nu koso a ebie ngora mmukye ne nwa nyoo:<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“Mese wɔ adwuma. Nea, mafa anoa bɔ babukye masie wɔ nyunu, sɔ anoa ne, ebiala ngɔhora nu to. Mese kyɛ ɛlle anwoserɛ pa, nakoso ali me dwirɛ so, na ɛpolle me dumaa. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Nea, bɛ bɔ bɛta Satan si ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛte sua bɔ Satan yianu ne.”</char></note> ngondombofoɛ bɔ bɛnwa bɛte Yudafoɛ nakoso ɔtte nahorɛ ne, ngɔmaa bɛkɔwa wɔ nyunu bɛkɔɔkoto wɔ gya bo, na bekonwu kyɛ, mekuro wɔ dwirɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ali me dwirɛ bɔ ɔfa animia nwo naso nati, me koso, nzɔhwɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɔba wiase mukoraati basɔ aseɛ he asofoɛ nea ne, ngɔbɔ wɔ nwo waen ngofi ye nwo. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Meyɛ ndɛ meba. Tira bɔ ɛle ye nanu yé, na ebiala anne wɔ abotire ne amvi wɔ sa nu. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, ngɔmaa ɔkɔyɛ pila wɔ me Nyameɛ asɔre awuro berɛ na ɔngofi berɛ ngɔfite kõ. Na ngɔhworɔ me Nyameɛ dumaa, me Nyameɛ kuro bɔ yeɛ ole Yerusalem foforɛ bɔ ofi me Nyameɛ berɛ wɔ anwuro odwu ne dumaa, ɔne me dumaa foforɛ ne ngogua ye nwo.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne.”’<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Tworɔ kɔma Laodikea asafo n'abɔfo ne kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="REV 3:14">‘Amen ne, adanzeniɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ na ɛkora fa wɔ nwo to ye so, Nyameɛ abɔdeɛ ahyɛaseɛ ne nwa nyoo:<verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“Mese wɔ adwuma; wɔ ahɔ a ɛnyɛ hye, na wɔ koso ɛtte frɔlɔɔ. Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa ɛyɛ hye anaa ɛte frɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ayɛ nnedɛɛ-nnedɛɛ, na wɔ ahɔ a ɛnyɛ hye, ná koso ɛtte frɔlɔɔ nati, ngɔfe wɔ ngofi me noa nu.” <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ofikyɛ ɛka kyɛ “Nde sikaniɛ, nne agyapadeɛ pee, na menhia hwee.” Nakoso ɛnze kyɛ sãa wɔ dwirɛ yɛ anwunvo, wɔ nwo yɛ aworabɔ, wahia wɔ, wɔ nye asi, ná ɛla adagya. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Yeti metu wɔ fo, tɔ sikaa kɔkorɛ bɔ bɛ afa bafa see nu fi me berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛkɔyɛ sikaniɛ, na tɔ ndadeɛ fufue, bɔ ɛkɔfa kowura kɔkata wɔ adagya naso ná amvɛle. Na tɔ ayire bɔ ɛkɔfa kɔyɛ wɔ nye naso ná ahora anwu nikye. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Bɛ bɔ mekuro bɛ dwirɛ namukoraati, metwi bɛ nyunu na metwe bɛ so. Yeti maa wɔ nye boro, na sakra.’ <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />‘Nea, ngyi anoa ne si mebɔ nu. Sɛ ebie te me konvi na obukye me a, ngɔwa ye awuro, ná mene ye adidi, na ye koso ɔne me adidi. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Bɔ okoli ngunim ne, ngɔmaa ɔne me kɔtena me bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire bia bɔ ɔhene tena so ne. </char></note> naso, kyɛbɔ me koso nnili ngunim, na mene me Baba tenane ye bia naso ne.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie bɔ honhom ne ka kyire asafo nemɔ ne.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, ndole me nye, na nwuni kyɛ babukye anoa bie wɔ anwuro. Na konviɛ bɔ nni moa ndele, bɔ né wayɛ kyɛ awɛen ne ha hyirele me kyɛ: “Fo bra wa, na ngɔmaa ekonwu nningyein bɔ odikyɛ osisi ne.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Na ɛberɛ ala, honhom ne wale me so. Mekwaanea a, ɔhene bia bie gyi anwuro, na ebie te sɔ bia naso. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Bɔ ɔte so ne, ɔta hyireinn te kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">jasper</char> ne nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">sardius</char> ne. Né nyangondoen apɛ bia nanwo mukoraati ayia, na né nyangondoen ne te kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">emerald</char> ne. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Né ahemvo bia 24 apɛ sɔ bia nanwo ayia, na nwuni mbanyi 24 bɔ bewuro-wura ndadeɛ fufue kyɛ bɛtete ahemvo bia nemɔ so, na ɔhene kyerɛ bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ bayɛ wuro-wura bɛ ti. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Na agralaa bɔ ɔte yerɛm-yerɛm, konviɛ ahoroɛ, ne agralaa bɔ obobɔnu fi ɔhene bia nanu ba. Na né see nganea nzoo sɔ wɔ ɔhene bia ne nyunu; sɔ nganea ne gyi berɛ ma Nyameɛ honhom nzoo ne. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ne nikye bie wɔ ɔhene bia ne nyunu te kyɛ ahwehwɛ-ɛpo, né ye nye te paa te kyɛ ahwehwɛ ne. Ne ateasefoɛ nna gyigyi ɔhene bia nanwo, na anyeɛ wɔ bɛ nyunu ne bɛ si mukoraati. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ateasefoɛ bɔ oli moa ne te kyɛ gyata, bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne te kyɛ nandwie ba, bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne nyunu soma sona nyunu, na bɔ ɔtɔ so nna ne te kyɛ kɔleɛ bɔ otu ne. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Na ateasefoɛ nna nanu biala le ndaa nzia; na anyeɛ apɛ bɛ ndaa nanwo mukoraati ayia. Na eyia ne kɔngɔen biala bɛka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Krongron, krongron, krongron yeɛ ole Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">Ye yeɛ né ɔwɔ berɛ, na ɔtɛ́ wɔ berɛ, na ɔba ne.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Mmerɛ biala bɔ ateasefoɛ nemɔ kɔfa anuonyam, nidie ne asennaa kɔma bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso, bɔ ɔte ase daa daa ne, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />mbanyi 24 ne bu ndwerɛ wɔ bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne nyunu, na bɛsõ bɔ ɔte ase daa daa ne; bɛtutu bɛ kyerɛ bɛgua ɔhene bia ne nyunu, ná baha kyɛ:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Awurade, yɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">wɔ yeɛ anuonyam, nidie ne tumi fata wɔ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ofikyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛbɔle nikye biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">na wɔ pɛ ti yeɛ ɛbɔle maa bɛwale ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Na nwuni nwomaa bɔ babobɔ bie wɔ bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> naso ne sa famaa nu. Ne bahworɔ ye nyunu ne ye si mukoraati, na ne bafa stamp nzoo bateta ye noa. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Na nwuni kyɛ abɔfo bie bɔ ole anwoserɛ afa konviɛ pirikua bie atea nu kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔfata kyɛ obukye nwomaa bɔ babobɔ nanu, na ɔtete stamp nemɔ fi ye noa ɔ?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Nakoso anwuro oo, aseɛ so ne aseɛ bo oo, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔhora bukyele nwomaa bɔ babobɔ ne, na ɔneane nu ɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Na nzuni paa, ofikyɛ bannya ebiala bɔ ɔfata kyɛ obukye nwomaa bɔ babobɔ nanu, anaa ɔnea nu ɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Nakoso mbanyi nanu kõ ha hyirele me kyɛ: “Yakyi suɛ ne. Nea, Yuda abusuakue nanu Gyata ne, David ndii ne ali ngunim, yeti ɔkɔhora kobukye nwomaa bɔ babobɔ nanu, na watete stamp nzoo bɔ bafa bateta ye noa ne.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Na nwuni kyɛ, Boan Ba bie gyi ɔhene bia ne, ateasefoɛ nna ne, yeɛ mbanyi ne afia; boan ba ne, né wayɛ kyɛ bapɛ ye ti ne; na né ole mmɛen nzoo ne anyeɛ nzoo, na anyeɛ ne gyi berɛ ma Nyameɛ honhom nzoo bɔ wasoma bɛ wɔ aseɛ naso mukoraati ne. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Na ɔhɔle bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne berɛ, na olɛle nwomaa bɔ babobɔ ne fili ye sa famaa nanu. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Olɛle nwomaa nala pɛ, ateasefoɛ nna ne, bɛ ne mbanyi 24 ne butuli Boan Ba ne nyunu berɛ, né bɛ nu biala le dwotai ne sikaa kɔkorɛ kyɛnzee bɔ insɛns wɔ nu. (Insɛns ne te akrongronfoɛ né mbaeɛ.) <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Na bɛtole edwein foforɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Wɔ yeɛ ɛfata kyɛ edɛ nwomaa bɔ babobɔ ne, na ɛte ye stamp nemɔ noa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ofikyɛ bɛhuni wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">na ɛfale wɔ mogya tɔle mmenia fili abusuakue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">dwudwolɛ, mmenia ne maen biala nu mane Nyameɛ.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Na ayɛ bɛ ahemman ne asɔfo ama yɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">na bɛkoli aseɛ naso hene.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Afei ndole me nye, na ndele abɔfo pee bɔ bapɛ ateasefoɛ ne, mbanyi ne, ne ɔhene bia nanwo bayia ne konvi, ne bɛ dodoɔ te apepe-srala buburu-gyaa. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Na bɛteane nu bɛhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Boan Ba bɔ bɛhuni ye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">tumi, ahonyadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nyanza, anwoserɛ, nidie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">anuonyam ne nhyira fata ye.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Na ndele kyɛ abɔdeɛ biala bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro, aseɛ so, aseɛ bo, ɛpo nu, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ nu ne ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Nhyira, nidie, anuonyam ne tumi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ha bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">ɔne Boan ba ne daa, daa.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Na ateasefoɛ nna ne hane kyɛ: “Amen!” Na mbanyi ne fale bɛ nyunu butuli berɛ, na bɛsõne.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Na nwuni kyɛ Boan Ba ne ate stamp nzoo nanu kõ, na ndele kyɛ ateasefoɛ nna nanu kõ fa konviɛ bɔ ɔte kyɛ agralaa ka kyɛ: “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mekwaanea a, pɔngɔ fufue bie ɛhe! Na bɔ ɔte ye so ne tira agyan, na bɛmane ye ɔhene kyerɛ, na ɔhɔ oolili ngunim, na oyiele ye ngunim ne.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Boan Ba ne tele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne, ndele kyɛ ateasefoɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne ka kyɛ: “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Na pɔngɔ foforɛ kɔkorɛ kɔɔ bie yele ye ti, na bɛmane bɔ ɔte so ne tumi kyɛ ɔye asomdwie fi aseɛ naso, na ɔma mmenia huhu bɛ nwo. Bɛmane ye dadeɛ kandinga bie.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ɔtele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne, ndele kyɛ ateasefoɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne ka kyɛ: “Bra!” Mekwaanea a, pɔngɔ bire bie ɛhe! Na bɔ ɔte so ne tira skeil. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Na ndele konviɛ bie mvili ateasefoɛ nna nanu kyɛ: “Hwiit kongo kõ te dɛnare kõ, na atokoɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Baali.”</char></note> kongo nza te dɛnare kõ; anwa ne nzãa de, nnɛsɛkye ye.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ɔtele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nna ne, ndele kyɛ ateasefoɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nna ne ka kyɛ: “Bra!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Mekwaanea a, pɔngɔ hoyaa bie ɛhe. Na bɛfrɛ bɔ ɔte so ne ewue, na Asieleɛ li ye si pɛɛ. Na bɛhyɛle aseɛ nanu nna bɛmane bɛ kõ so tumi, kyɛ ɔfa dadeɛ, ɛhɔen, anwonyerɛ, ne aseɛ so ngaka suronyi-suronyi bɛhu bɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nnu ne, nwuni bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ dwirɛ, ɔne adanzeɛ bɔ bɛlili nati, bɛhuni bɛ ne kra wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea nabo. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Na bɛteane nu serɛ-serɛ kyɛ: “O Awurade Tumvoɛ, wɔ bɔ ɛte krongron na ɛdi nahorɛ, ɛkɔ nwondɛ koodwu kyẽa beni kora ne abu bɛ bɔ bɛte aseɛ naso ne atɛn, na atua bɛ kerɛ wɔ yɛ mogya nwo?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Na bɛmane bɛ nu biala atadeɛ fufue tendee bie, na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ, bɛle bɛ nwomeɛ kaa ma oodwu kyɛ, bɛ mmango ngoaa, ɔne bɛ liema mɔ bɔ bɛbaahu bɛ kyɛ bɛ ala ne dodoɔ kɔbɔ yenoa.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Ɔtele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia ne, nwuni ye, na aseɛ wosolɛ kandinga sili; na eyia yɛle tumm kyɛ brisie, na ɛsraen yɛle kyɛ mogya, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />na nzramaa bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne tete guale ase te kyɛ borɔdoma bɔ mvrama kandinga woso ye poro ye mma amui gua ne. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Na anwuro minini te kyɛ nwomaa bɔ bɛbobɔ ne, na bɛtuli bokaa ne supɔ biala bɛfili nekaa bɔ ɔwɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Afei aseɛ so ahemvo, atitire, sogyafoɛ mbanyi, asikafoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛle anwoserɛ, ngoaa ne bɛ bɔ balɛ́ bɛ nwo namukoraati feale kumaa ne mmokaa so nyɔbotaen mɔ nu. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Na bɛha bɛhyirele mmokaa ne nyɔboɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔɔgua yɛ so, na ɛmɔfa yɛ bɛfea bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> naso ne, ɔne Boan Ba ne yaa ne, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />ofikyɛ kyẽa piri bɔ bɛkɔfɛ yaa ne adwu, na nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kogyina ye noa ɔ?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, nwuni abɔfo nna kyɛ bɛgyigyi aseɛ ne ahameɛ nna ne, na né basosɔ aseɛ so mvrama nna nanu yé paa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, mvrama biala ngɔbɔ ngɔfa aseɛ ne, ɛpo ne, anaa mmakaa nemɔ so. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Nza nwuni abɔfo foforɛ kyɛ ofi eyia afiteleɛ ɔfo kɔ anwuro, na ne otira Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne stamp ne. Na ɔteane nu ha hyirele abɔfo nna bɔ bafa bawura bɛ sa kyɛ bɛsɛkye aseɛ ne ɛpo ne kyɛ: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Nnɛmɔ ha aseɛ ne, ɛpo ne, anaa mmakaa ne ma oodwu kyɛ yɛkɔhyɛ Nyameɛ ngoaa nemɔ nzorɛ wɔ bɛ nwoma so ɔ.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Na ndele bɛ bɔ bahyɛ bɛ nzorɛ ne dodoɔ, mmenia 144,000 yeɛ bɛhyɛle bɛ nzorɛ wɔ Israel mmaa mmusuakue namukoraati nu ɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Yuda abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Ruben abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">Gad abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Aser abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Naftali abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">Manase abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Simeon abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Lewi abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">Isakar abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Sebulun abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Yosef abusua nu, mmenia 12,000;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">Bengyamin abusua nu, mmenia 12,000 yeɛ bɛhyɛle bɛ nzorɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, ndole me nye, na nwuni mmeni lɔen kandinga bie bɔ sona biala ngɔhora bɛka, bɔ bɛfi maen, mmusuakue, mmenia, ne dwudwolɛ biala nu, kyɛ bɛgyi ɔhene bia ne, ɔne Boan Ba ne nyunu. Ne sɔ mmenia nemɔ wuro-wura ndadeɛ tendee fufue, na né bɛtire-tira ɛberɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Na bɛteane nu serɛ-serɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Yɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">ɔne Boan Ba ne yeɛ bɛkole yɛ ngoa ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Na abɔfo namukoraati pɛle ɔhene bia ne, mbanyi ne ateasefoɛ nna nanwo yiale, na bɛfale bɛ nyunu bɛ butuli ɔhene bia ne nyunu bɛsõne Nyameɛ, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Amen! Ayɛyie, anuonyam, nyanza, asennaa, nidie, tumi, ne anwoserɛ te yɛ Nyameɛ deɛ daa daa. Amen.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Afei, mbanyi nanu kõ bisale me kyɛ: “Nwamɔ yeɛ bɛwura ndadeɛ tendee fufue ne, na bɛfi nisua?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Yeti ɛberɛ ala yeɛ nga ngyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, ɛhe de, wɔ yeɛ ɛse ɔ.” Na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Ɛhemɔ yeɛ bafi ahohiehia kandinga nanu bafite ne, na bapo bɛ ndadeɛ maa wayɛ fufue hyɛnn wɔ Boan Ba ne mogya nanu. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛgyi Nyameɛ bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> ne nyunu ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">ná bɛsõ ye eyia ne kɔngɔen wɔ ye asɔre awuro berɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Na bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne kɔtrɛ ye tɛnt nanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">maa ɔkɔkata bɛ so.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Ɛhɔen ne nzuhɔen ngɔhu bɛ kõ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Sɔ ala yeɛ eyia ngɔyera bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">na ahuhuro biala ngɔhu bɛ.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Ofikyɛ Boan ba bɔ ɔwɔ ɔhene bia ne afia ne kɔnea bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Na okoli bɛ nyunu kɔhɔ nekaa bɔ ngoa nzue pukye fi ne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Na Nyameɛ kokyikyi bɛ nye mmoen mukoraati.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele stamp bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo ne, anwuro yɛle dinn kɔyɛ dɔnhwere bue. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Na nwuni abɔfo nzoo bɔ begyina Nyameɛ nyunu ne, na bɛmane bɛ awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> nzoo. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Afei abɔfo foforɛ bie wale, né otira sikaa kɔkorɛ kyɛnzee bɔ bɛfa bɛyera insɛns, ná oogyinane afɔleɛ bokyea nanwo berɛ. Yeɛ bɛmane ye insɛns pee kyɛ ɔfa boka akrongronfoɛ mbaeɛ naso, ná ɔfa bɔ afɔleɛ wɔ sikaa kɔkorɛ afɔleɛ bokyea bɔ ɔwɔ ɔhene bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> ne nyunu naso. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Na insɛns ne nwosina ne fili abɔfo ne sa nu, na ɔne akrongronfoɛ ne mbaeɛ ne hɔle Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Na ɛberɛ ala, abɔfo ne fale kyɛnzee bɔ bɛfa bɛyera insɛns ne, na ɔfale afɔleɛ bokyea naso see ne bie guale nu maa oyili, na ogyi tole aseɛ naso. Na agralaa bobɔle nu, bɛtele konviɛ ahoroɛ, agralaa tetele yerɛm-yerɛm, na aseɛ wosolɛ wale.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Afei, abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtira awɛen nzoo ne boɔboale bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛbaahu b'awɛen ne.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Bɔ oli moa ne huli ye awɛen ne, na asukɔtwea ne see bɔ ɔne mogya ali afra wale, na bɛgyi bɛguale aseɛ naso. Na aseɛ ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ yerale; mmakaa ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ yerale, na ndire monɛ mukoraati yerale koraa.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne huli ye awɛen ne. Na bɛgyili nikye bie bɔ wayɛ kyɛ bokaa kandinga bɔ ɔyera bɛtole ɛpo nanu. Na ɛpo ne ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ kakyile mogya, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />na nningyein bɔ ngoa wɔ nu bɔ ɔwɔ ɛpo nanu ne, enu ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ wuli, na hyep ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ sɛkyele.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne huli ye awɛen ne. Na nzramaa kandinga bie bɔ ɔsɔ te kyɛ kanea te fili anwuro, na ɔɔtɔle nzue bɔ ɔtengyɛ ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ, ɔne nekaa bɔ nzue pukye fi ne. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nzramaa ne dumaa li Abɔwee. Na nzue ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ yɛle abɔwee, na nzue ne maa mmenia pee wuli, ofikyɛ né ɔyɛ wee.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nna ne huli ye awɛen ne. Na bɛfale nikye bɛbɔle eyia ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ, ɛsraen ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ, yeɛ nzramaa ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ nu ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ konua, na aleheneɛ ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ annya kanea, na kɔngɔen ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ koso annya kanea.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Na nneane ne, ndele kyɛ kɔleɛ bie tea nu wɔ ewienu kyɛ: “Bɛ bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso ne, bɛ yaakɔ! bɛ yaakɔ oo! bɛ yaakɔ! ɔnate awɛen ne ngaa bɔ abɔfo nza ne baahu ne dede nati.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Na abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nnu ne huli ye awɛen ne. Na nwuni kyɛ nzramaa bie ate afi anwuro waatɔ aseɛ so, na bɛfale kumaa kuron-kuron ne nzafoa bɛmane ye. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Na obukyele kumaa kuron-kuron ne noa, na nwosina bɔ ɔte kyɛ fonoo kandinga bie nu nwosina fili kumaa nanu wale, na kumaa nanu nwosina ne maa eyia ne ewienu yɛle tumm. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Na mmɛbɛ fili nwosina nanu wale aseɛ so, na bɛmane bɛ tumi; sɔ tumi ne bie yeɛ anyanyangyeleɛ bɔ bɛwɔ aseɛ naso ne le ne. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛha ndire, nyaa monɛ, anaa bakaa biala bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ naso ne, mmom bɛha mmenia bɔ bɛlle Nyameɛ stamp ne bie wɔ bɛ nwoma so ne. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Bamma mmɛbɛ nemɔ angu bɛ, mmom bɛmane bɛ atee kyɛ bɛyɛ bɛ ayayade bosome nnu. Na ayayade bɔ bɛyɛle bɛ ne, ne ɔte kyɛ yealɛ bɔ ebie te, mmerɛ bɔ anyanyangyeleɛ aha ye ne. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, mmenia kɔpena ewue, nakoso bɛngɔ nwu ye, ɔhale bɛ ngome a, ahaa bawu, nakoso, ewue kɔnwati kofi bɛ nwo.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Né mmɛbɛ nemɔ soma pɔngɔ bɔ bɛfa bɛ bɛkɔ koɛ ne; né nikye bie bɔ wayɛ kyɛ sikaa kɔkorɛ abotire bobɔ bɛ ti, na bɛ nyunu te kyɛ sona nyunu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Bɛ ti so nwiaa te kyɛ mmrasua nwiaa, na bɛ gye te kyɛ gyata gye. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Né nikye bie kata bɛ hue so te kyɛ buralɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛkata bɛ hue so ne, na dede bɔ bɛ ndaa ne yɛ ne, ɔte kyɛ teaseɛnam somaa bɔ mbɔngɔ twe bɛ kri-di-di kɔ koɛ ne. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Afei, bɛle dua bɔ ɔwowɔ te kyɛ anyanyangyeleɛ, na bɛ dua nanu yeɛ tumi bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔyɛ mmenia ayayade bosome nnu ne wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Bɛle ɔhene bɔ odi bɛ so, ye yeɛ ole abɔfo bɔ ɔnea kumaa naso ne. Hebri nu ne, bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">Abadon</char>,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yebo kyire “Sɛkyelɛ.”</char></note> na Greek nu de, bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">Apolion</char>.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yebo kyire “Sɛkyefoɛ.”</char></note><verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Mmusue kõ apɛ nu. Na tie, ɛhe si ne, mmusue nyɔ koso kɔwa.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia ne huli ye awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> ne. Na ndele konviɛ bie mvili mmɛen bɔ ogyi-gyi sikaa kɔkorɛ afɔleɛ bokyea bɔ ɔwɔ Nyameɛ nyunu nanu, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />ɔha hyirele abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia bɔ otira awɛen ne kyɛ: “Sangye abɔfo nna bɔ bakyekye bɛ wɔ Eufrate nzue kandinga nanwo ne.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Yeti abɔfo bɔ basiesie bɛ bama dɔnhwere ne, kyẽa ne, bosome ne, ne afoɛ ne, bɛsangyele bɛ kyɛ bɛhu mmenia nanu ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Na ndele sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛtena mbɔngɔ so bɛkõ ne dodoɔ, ne bɛte 200,000,000.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Apee abura-nyɔ bɔ bafa babɔ ye nwo apee buru; (kyire kyɛ, 20,000×10,000.) ”</char></note> <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ná anisoadehu nu ne, sɔa yeɛ nwuni mbɔngɔ ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtete bɛ so ne ɔ: Né buralɛ kata bɛ hue so, na né buralɛ nemɔ kɔla né te kɔkorɛ kɔɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Kɔɔ te kyɛ see</char></note> bluu,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Bluu te kyɛ sapphire.</char></note> yeɛ yalo.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Yalo te kyɛ sɔfa.</char></note> Né mbɔngɔ nemɔ ti te kyɛ gyata ti, na see, nwosina ne sɔfa fi bɛ noa nu fite. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Sɛ ɛkyɛ mmenia nanu nza a, see, nwosina, ne sɔfa bɔ ofi bɛ noa nanu wale ne, ohuni bɛ nu kõ. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Na tumi bɔ mbɔngɔ nemɔ le ye ne, ɔwɔ bɛ noa ne bɛ dua nanu, ofikyɛ bɛ dua ne te kyɛ ɛwoo bɔ ole tire, na ɛhene yeɛ bɛfa bɛpira mmenia ɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Na mmenia ne ngaa bɔ sɔ haw hemɔ angu bɛ ne, nningyein bɔ bɛfa bɛ sa bɛyɛ ne, banyakyi. Na sunzummɔne ne nningyein bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ, dwetɛ, kɔɔbere, nyɔboɛ, ne mmakaa bayɛ ne, né betɛ́ so bɛ; sɔ nningyein hemɔ nnwu nikye, bɛnde dwirɛ, na bɛngora nate po. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Ná b'awudie, b'ahonhomzɛm, b'adwaman, ne b'awie ne koso, banzakra bamvi ye nwo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Na nwuni abɔfo foforɛ bɔ ole anwoserɛ paa kyɛ odwu fi anwuro, ne wafa munungum wahra, na nyangondoen wɔ ye ti so, né ye nyunu te kyɛ eyia, na ne ye gya te kyɛ see pila. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Né otira nwomaa kamba bie bɔ basangye nu wɔ ye sa nu. Na ɔfale ye gya famaa siele ɛpo nu, yeɛ ɔfale bɛen ne siele aseɛ so. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Na ɔfale konviɛ kandinga teane nu te kyɛ gyata bɔ ɔbobɔ nu ne. Ɔteane nu ne, agralaa nzoo ne dwudwole. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Agralaa nzoo ne dwudwole ne, ahaa metworɔ, nakoso ndele konviɛ bie mvili anwuro kyɛ: “Edwirɛ bɔ agralaa nzoo ne hane ne, fa fea, nnɛ tworɔ.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Na abɔfo bɔ nwuni ye kyɛ ogyi aseɛ ne ɛpo so ne mane ye sa famaa so hɔle anwuro, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />na ɔtale bɔ ɔte ase daa daa, bɔ ɔbɔle anwuro ne enu nningyein, aseɛ ne enu nningyein, ne ɛpo ne enu nningyein ne ndaen kyɛ: “Ɔngɔ nwondɛ kõ. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Mmom, kyɛ dee bɔ abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo ne hu ye awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> ne, né Nyameɛ dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea, bɔ ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ hyirele ye bɔbɔ ye ngoaa adiifoɛ ne awa nu.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Na konviɛ bɔ nde mvili anwuro ne, osa ne me dwudwole bieku, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Kɔ abɔfo bɔ ogyi ɛpo ne aseɛ so ne berɛ, na kole nwomaa bɔ enu asangye, bɔ ɔwɔ ye sa nu ne.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Na ngɔle abɔfo ne berɛ, yeɛ nga ngyirele ye kyɛ, ɔfa nwomaa kamba ne ma me. Yeɛ ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “De, na di, na ɔkɔyɛ wee-wee wɔ wɔ kunu, nakoso wɔ noa nu de, ɔkɔyɛ fɛ kyɛ woɛ.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Na nnɛle nwomaa kamba ne mvili abɔfo ne sa nu nnili, na ɔyɛle me noa nu fɛɛ-fɛɛ kyɛ woɛ, nakoso nni nyiele ye, ɔyɛle wee-wee wɔ me kunu. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Na bɛha bɛhyirele me kyɛ: “Odikyɛ ɛhyɛ mmenia, maen, dwudwolɛ, ne ahemvo pee nwo ngɔm bieku.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Na ɔfale elemmire bɔ wayɛ kyɛ bakaa tendee bie mane me, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Dwɔso, na susu Nyameɛ asɔre awuro ne né afɔleɛ bokyea ne, na ka bɛ bɔ bɛsõ [Nyameɛ] wɔ berɛ ne. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Nakoso, asɔre awuro né aluo berɛ ne de, yakyi, nnɛsusu, ofikyɛ bafa bama maen-maen ne, na bɛkɔfa bɛ gya bɛkotietia kuro krongron naso bosome 42. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Na ngɔmaa m'adanzefoɛ nyɔ ne kowura brisie, ná bahyɛ ngɔm ngyẽa 1,260.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Sɔ adanzefoɛ nyɔ hemɔ gyi berɛ ma olive mmakaa nyɔ ne kanea mmakaa nyɔ bɔ bɛgyi aseɛ Wura ne nyunu ne. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ opira bɛ a, see fi bɛ noa nu bayera b'atamfo nemɔ. Ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔha bɛ ne, sɔ atee he aso yeɛ odikyɛ bɛku ye ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Sɔ adanzefoɛ hemɔ le tumi kyɛ bɛto anwuro nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngyẽa bɔ bɛhyɛ bɛ ngɔm ne, nzue ngɔtɔ, na bɛle tumi bɔ bɛmaa nzue kakyi mogya, ná bɛfa ɔhaw biala bie bɛba aseɛ naso mmerɛ biala bɔ bɛkuro ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Sɛ beyie bɛ adanzeɛ ne a, kaka suronyi-suronyi bɔ ofili kumaa kuron-kuron nanu wale ne, ɔne bɛ kɔhõ, okoli bɛ so ngunim na wahu bɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Na bɛ fuin ne kogua kuro kandinga ne dwaaso, sɔ kuro ne yeɛ honhom nu bɛfrɛ ye Sodom ne Egypt ne. Na ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛbɔle b'Awurade asɛnnua nu ne. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛfi abusuakue, dwudwolɛ, ne maen ahoroɛ nu kɔnea bɛ fuin ne ɛlɛsa ne bue, na bɛngɔma bɛngɔfa bɛ fuin ne bɛngɔgua kumaa nu. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Na bɛ ti, mmenia bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso ne nye kɔgye, bɛkoli ahurusi na bahyehyɛ bɛ nwo nikye, ofikyɛ sɔ adiifoɛ nyɔ he maa bɛ bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso ne nwo yerale bɛ paa. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Na ɛlɛsa né si ne, ngoa honhom fili Nyameɛ berɛ wurale bɛ nu, na bɛdwɔso bɛgyinane bɛ gya so, na esuronyi hane bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni bɛ ne paa. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Na bɛtele kyɛ konviɛ piri bie fi anwuro ka kyire bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfo bɛbra wa!” Na bɛfale munungum nu bɛhɔle anwuro, wɔ b'atamfo nemɔ nyunu. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ala, aseɛ wosolɛ kandinga bie sili, na kuro né ngyekyɛmue buru nu kõ bubuli, na aseɛ wosolɛ ne hunu mmenia 7,000, na esuronyi hane bɛ ngaa ne, yeti bɛhyɛle anwuro Nyameɛ ne anuonyam.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Mmusue bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne awa awieɛ. Nea, ɔngɔhyɛ, bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne kɔwa.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo ne huli ye awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.” </char></note> ne. Na konviɛ pee teɛteane nu wɔ anwuro kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Wiase ahennie ayɛ y'Awurade ne ye Kristo ne deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">na okoli hene daa daa.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Na mbanyi 24 bɔ bɛtete bɛ bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> so wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu ne fale bɛ nyunu butuli berɛ, na bɛsõne Nyameɛ <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />bɛhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Awurade, Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">wɔ yeɛ ne ɛwɔ berɛ, ná etɛ́ wɔ berɛ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Yɛda wɔ ase kyɛ afa wɔ tumi kandinga ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">ná ahyɛ yebo edi tumi.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Nakoso maen-maen ne fɛle yaa paa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">na wɔ koso ɛfɛle yaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Na mmerɛ aso kyɛ ebu awufo atɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ná ɛfa wɔ ngoaa adiifoɛ, akrongronfoɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ne bɛ bɔ bɛsuro wɔ dumaa ne akatua ma bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">mmaa-mmaa ne mbiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ná ɛsɛkye bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye aseɛ ne.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Afei bɛbukyele Nyameɛ asɔre awuro bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, na bɛnwuni ye apam alaka ne wɔ ye asɔre awuro berɛ. Na agralaa bobɔle nu, agralaa tetele yerɛm-yerɛm, na dede, aseɛ wosolɛ ne asukɔtwea wale.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Nzɛngyerɛneɛ kandinga bie sili anwuro: Né brasua bie ahra eyia, bɔ né ɛsraen wɔ ye gya bo, na ne abotire bɔ bafa nzramaa 12 bayɛ bɔ ye ti. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Né ɔnwonzɛ, na aworɛ hane ye; na amaneɛ ne yealɛ bɔ ne onwu nati, né ɔteɛtea nu. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Afei nzɛngyerɛneɛ bieku sili anwuro: ɛwoo kandinga kɔkorɛ suronyi-suronyi bie yele ye ti. Né ole tire nzoo, ne mmɛen buru, na ahemotire nzoo bobɔ ye ti nanwo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Na ɔfale ye dua hwene anwuro nzramaa ngyekyɛmue nza nu kõ, na ogyili bɛ guale aseɛ naso. Na ɛwoo ne gyinane brasua bɔ aworɛ aha ye ne nyunu, kyɛ ɔwo ala a, ɔkye ɔwa ne di. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Na ɔwole baa brienzua, ye yeɛ ne ɔkɔfa buralɛ pɔmaa koli maen biala so ne. Nakoso bɛfale ɔwa ne bɛhɔle nekaa bɔ Nyameɛ ne ye bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.” </char></note> ne wɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Na brasua ne nwati hɔle ɛserɛ so, nekaa bɔ Nyameɛ asiesie ama ye kyɛ bɛma ye aleɛ ngyẽa 1,260.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Na ngondii sili anwuro. Mikael ne ye abɔfo ne ɛwoo ne hone, na ɛwoo ne koso ne ye abɔfo ne bɛ hone; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />nakoso ɛwoo ne né ye abɔfo nemɔ angora, na bamma bɛ atee maa bandena anwuro kõ. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Yeti, bɛgyili ɛwoo suronyi-suronyi ne bɛtole aseɛ so, sɔ daa tete ɛwoo bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Abɔnzam ne Satan, bɔ ɔlaka-laka aseɛ sofoɛ mukoraati ne, bɛgyili ye bɛtole aseɛ naso, na bɛgyili ye abɔfo nemɔ koso bɛ bokale yeso. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Na ndele konviɛ kandinga bie wɔ anwuro kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Bekye bɔ yɛ Nyameɛ ne ngwagyeɛ, ne ye Ahennie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ne ye Kristo ne tumi awa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">ofikyɛ bagyi bɔ ɔbɔ yɛliema mɔ kwaadu ne bato ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">bɔ né ɔbɔ bɛ kwaadu eyia ne kɔngɔen ne.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Na ɔnate Boan ba né mogya ne adanzeɛ bɔ bɛlili naso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">yeɛ ɔmaa bɛlili ye so ngunim ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Na sɛ ɔba kyɛ bɛku bɛ po a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">né bɛndwene bɛ ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> nwo.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Yeti, anwuro ne ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ tete nu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Aseɛ ne ɛpo de, bɛ yaakɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ofikyɛ Abɔnzam adwu awa ɛmɔ berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">na wafɛ yaa paa, ofikyɛ, ɔse kyɛ waha ye mmerɛ kaa bie.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɛwoo ne nwuni kyɛ bagyi ye bato aseɛ so ne, otuli ye nye siele brasua bɔ ɔwole baa brienzua naso. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Nakoso, bɛfale kɔleɛ kandinga ne ndaa nyɔ ne bɛmane brasua ne, kyɛ ɔfa tu fi ɛwoo ne nyunu hɔ ɛserɛ so, nekaa bɔ ne bɛkɔma ye aleɛ afoɛ nza ne bue,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Mmerɛ nza ne bue.”</char></note> na ɛwoo ne anya ye. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Na ɛwoo ne puli ye noa nu nzue bɔ ɔte kyɛ nzue kandinga lili braa ne si kyɛ ɔfa ye. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Nakoso aseɛ bokale brasua ne, aseɛ memene nzue bɔ ɛwoo ne pu fili ye noa nu ne. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Yeti, ɛwoo ne fɛle brasua naso yaa paa, na ɔne ye bosofoɛ bɔ baha, bɔ bɛdi Nyameɛ mmeraa so ná bɛtira Yesu Kristo adanzeɛ adwuma nanu ne hone. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />-<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Na oogyinane anweaa bɔ ɔwɔ ɛpo ne noa naso. Na nwuni kyɛ kaka suronyi-suronyi bie fi ɛpo nanu ofite, né ole tiri nzoo ne mmɛen buru, na ne ahemotire buru bobɔ ye mmɛen nanwo, na mmusue dumaa wɔ ye ti nemɔ nwo. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Kaka suronyi-suronyi bɔ nwuni ye ne, né ɔte kyɛ sebɔ, nakoso ne ye gya te kyɛ kwabrafo gya, na né ye noa te kyɛ gyata noa. Na ɛwoo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ: “Ɛwoo kandinga bɔ ye nwo yɛ suro ne.”</char></note> ne fale ye anwoserɛ, ye bia,<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> ne ye tumi kandinga né mane kaka<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ: “Kaka suronyi-suronyi ne.”</char></note> ne. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Na nwuni kyɛ ye ti nemɔ nu kõ de, wayɛ kyɛ ɛnwa bapira ye paa, nakoso né ye kena ne ahɔ. Na kaka ne nwo yɛle aseɛ sofoɛ mukoraati nwanwa maa belili ye si. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Na bɛsõne ɛwoo ne, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ ɔfale tumi mane kaka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ: “Kaka suronyi-suronyi ne.”</char></note> ne ɔ. Na bɛsõne kaka ne bɛhane kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔte kyɛ kaka suronyi-suronyi ne ɔ? Na nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora ye ne ye kõ ɔ?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Bɛmane ye noa bɔ ɔfa keka edwirɛ mbiri-mbiri ne mmusue dwirɛ, na bɛmane ye atee kyɛ oli tumi bosome 42. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Na obukyele ye noa kekane mmusue dwirɛ tiale Nyameɛ, odwudwo tiale ye dumaa ne nekaa bɔ ɔte ne, kyire kyɛ, odwudwo tiale bɛ bɔ bɛtete anwuro ne. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Na bɛmane ye atee kyɛ ɔne akrongronfoɛ nemɔ hõ, na oli bɛ so ngunim; na bɛmane ye tumi wɔ abusuakue, mmenia, dwudwolɛ ne maen biala so. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso mukoraati kɔsõ ye. Na ofi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle wiase ne, bɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ne bahworɔ ye dumaa wɔ Boan Ba bɔ bɛhuni ye né ngoa nwomaa<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nwomaa bɔ babobɔ.”</char></note> nanu ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Sɛ ebie le asoɛ a, ma otie.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Sɛ odikyɛ ebie kɔ nnɔmun nu a, ɔkɔhɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Sɛ odikyɛ bɛfa dadeɛ beku ebie a, bɛkɔfa bɛkɔhu ye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Ɛwa yeɛ ohia paa kyɛ akrongronfoɛ nemɔ mia bɛ nye, na benya gyidie ne.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Na nza nwuni kaka suronyi-suronyi foforɛ kyɛ ofi aseɛ nu ofite, né ole mmɛen nyɔ te kyɛ boan ba, nakoso ɔhyɛle yebo dwudwole te kyɛ ɛwoo bɔ ye nwo yɛ suro. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Na ɔfale kaka bɔ oli moa né tumi mukoraati yɛle adwuma wɔ ye nyunu. Na ɔhyɛle aseɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛtete so namukoraati maa bɛsõne kaka bɔ oli moa, bɔ né wapira maa ye kena ne ahɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Na ɔyɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ mbiri-mbiri; ɔmaa see po fili anwuro wale aseɛ so wɔ ebiala nyunu. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Na nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ onyane atee yɛle ye wɔ kaka ne nyunu nati, ɔlaka-lakale bɛ bɔ bɛtete aseɛ naso namu, na ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛte aseɛ naso ne kyɛ, bɛyɛ statu bɛma kaka bɔ bɛpɛle ye dadeɛ, na ye kena ne ahɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Na bɛmane ye atee maa ohuli nwomeɛ mane kaka né statu ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, kaka né statu ne kodwudwo, ná ebiala bɔ onguro kyɛ ɔkɔsõ ye ne, wamaa bahu ye.<verse eid="REV 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Na ɔhyɛle ebiala, kwahweabaa oo, sona titire oo, sikaniɛ oo, hianiɛ oo, akoaa ne bɔ ɔtte akoaa mukoraati kyɛ, bɛhyɛ bɛ nzorɛ wɔ bɛ sa famaa nwo, anaa bɛ nwoma so. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Na sɛ ebie kɔhora kɔtɔ anaa ɔkɔtɔne nikye a, sana ole sɔ ahyɛnsodeɛ, bɔ yeɛ ole kaka ne dumaa anaa ye dumaa ne namba ne bie ne. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ɛwa yeɛ nyanza nwo hia paa ne. Ebiala bɔ ɔse nworɛ ne, ma ɔsese kaka ne namba ne, ofikyɛ, ɔte sona namba, na namba né te 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Afei ndole me nye, mekwaanea a, Boan Ba ne gyi Zion Bokaa naso, na mmenia 144,000 bɔ bahworɔ ye dumaa ne ye Baba dumaa bagua bɛ nwoma so ne boka ye so. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Na ndele dede bie mvili anwuro, ne dede ne ayɛ kyɛ nzue pee bɔ obu fa so, ne agralaa bɔ ɔbobɔ nu serɛ-serɛ ne; na ne wayɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛto dwein, bɔ bɛbɔ bɛ dwotai ne. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Ne bɛto dwein bie wɔ ɔhene bia ne né ateasefoɛ nna ne né mbanyi ne nyunu; na né wayɛ kyɛ edwein foforɛ bie. Na ebiala angora anzua sɔ dwein ne, sana mmenia 144,000 bɔ batɔ bɛ bafi aseɛ so ne ngome. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ɛhemɔ yeɛ bamva mmrasua bangua bɛ nwo fiɛ; nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ nwo te.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔkɔhora kohyire kyɛ: “Bɛte mmabunu.”</char></note> Na nekaa biala bɔ Boan Ba ne kɔhɔ ne, bɛdi ye si. Ɛhemɔ yeɛ batɔ bɛ bafi aseɛ naso kyɛ aba bɔ oli moa bama Nyameɛ ne Boan Ba ne. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Bannwu ngondombo biala wɔ bɛ noa nu; na dɛm biala nne bɛ nwo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Afei nwuni abɔfo foforɛ kyɛ watu nate ewienu, né otira daa nzɛmba bɔ ɔkwaaha kyire bɛ bɔ bɛte aseɛ naso ne—maen, mmusuakue, dwudwolɛ ne mmenia mukoraati. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsuro Nyameɛ, na ɛmɔhyɛ ye anuonyam, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɔbaafa bu atɛn ne aso. Yeti ɛmɔsõ bɔ ɔbɔle anwuro ne aseɛ ne ɛpo ne nzue ti ne.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Na abɔfo foforɛ lili ye si wale, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Wafi ase! Babilon Kandinga ne afi ase. Ye yeɛ ɔmaa maen-maen namukoraati none ye adwamammɔ akɔnnɔ nanwo nzãa ne bie ne!”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ɛhene si ne, abɔfo foforɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nza wale, na ɔteane nu hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie sõ kaka suronyi-suronyi ne né ye statu ne, na odɛ ahyɛnsodeɛ ne bie gua ye nwoma so anaa ye sa nwo a, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />ye de Nyameɛ ɛyaa-fɛlɛ nzãa gyengɔɔ-gyengɔɔ bɔ wahwie wagua ye yaa-fɛlɛ kwangoa nanu ne, ɔkɔno bie; na bɛkɔyɛ ye ayayade wɔ see ne sɔfa nu wɔ abɔfo krongron ne né Boan Ba ne nyunu. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Na nwosina bɔ okofi bɛ ayayade nanu ne kɔfo kɔhɔ anwuro daa daa. Na bɛ bɔ bɛsõne kaka ne né ye statu ne, ɔne ebiala bɔ olɛle ye dumaa né ahyɛnsodeɛ ne bie ne, bɛngonya mmerɛ bɛngole bɛ nwomeɛ eyia anaa kɔngɔen.<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />“Ɛwa yeɛ odikyɛ akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛdi Nyameɛ ahyɛdeɛ so, ná bɛle gyidie wɔ Yesu nu ne mia bɛ nye ne.”<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Na ndele konviɛ bie mvili anwuro kyɛ: “Tworɔ ɛhe: ‘Ofi sɔ mmerɛ he bɔ ɔkɔ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛkowu wɔ Awurade nu ne, bɛle anigye.’ Honhom ne nwa: ‘Amba, bɛkole bɛ nwomeɛ bɛkofi bɛ fɛɛ nwo, ofikyɛ b'adwuma li bɛ si.’”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Afei ndole me nye, na nwuni munungum fufue bie, né ebie bɔ wayɛ kyɛ Sona Awa ne te munungum naso, bɔ sikaa kɔkorɛ kyerɛ wura ye ti ná otira koateɛ naen-naen bie wɔ ye sa nu. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Na abɔfo foforɛ fili asɔre awuro berɛ fitele, na ɔteane nu ha hyirele bɔ ɔte munungum naso ne kyɛ: “Fa wɔ koateɛ ne, na pɛ, ofikyɛ mmerɛ aso; na nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ naso ne aboro.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Na bɔ ɔte munungum so ne hwene ye koateɛ ne hɔle aseɛ so, na ɔpɛle nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ naso ne.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Na abɔfo foforɛ fili asɔre awuro bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro nanu fitele, ye koso, né otira koateɛ naen-naen bie. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Na abɔfo foforɛ fili afɔleɛ bokyea nanwo berɛ fitele, ye yeɛ né ole tumi wɔ see naso ne. Na ɔteane nu ha hyirele bɔ otira koateɛ naen-naen ne kyɛ: “Fa wɔ koateɛ naen-naen ne, na boɔboa aseɛ naso bobe taperɛ nemɔ noa, ofikyɛ ye mmaa ne aboro.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Yeti abɔfo ne hwene ye koateɛ ne hɔle aseɛ so, na ɔboɔboale bobe bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ so ne noa, na ohwie guale Nyameɛ ɛyaa piri kumaa bɔ bɛtwi nzãa wɔ nu nanu. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Bɛtietiale bobe naso wɔ kuro ne si, na mogya fili kumaa bɔ bɛtwi nzãa wɔ nu nanu wale, né ɔne pɔngɔ tendee te pɛ,<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɔyɛ kyɛ mita 1.5</char></note> na ɔtengyɛ pɛle kwanzii kɔyɛ 184.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Nza nwuni nzɛngyerɛneɛ foforɛ wɔ anwuro, né ɔte piri, na né ɔyɛ suro; abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtire-tira ɔhaw nzoo; ɛhene yeɛ ole ɔhaw bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, ofikyɛ ɔnate ɛhe aso yeɛ Nyameɛ yaa ne kɔwa awieɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Na nwuni nikye bie te kyɛ ahwehwɛ-ɛpo bɔ ɔne see ali afra. Na bɛ bɔ bali kaka ne, ye statu ne, ɔne ye dumaa namba naso ngunim ne gyigyi ahwehwɛ-ɛpo nanwo, bɔ bɛtira Nyameɛ dwotai ne wɔ bɛ sa nu. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Né bɛto Nyameɛ akoaa Mose dwein ne Boan Ba ne dwein kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Awurade, Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Wɔ nyumaa te mbiri na ɔyɛ nwanwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ɔhene bɔ ɛwɔ berɛ daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">W'atee tengyɛ na ɔte nahorɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Awurade, nwa yeɛ ɔngosuro wɔ ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Na nwa yeɛ ɔngɔhyɛ wɔ dumaa ne anuonyam ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Wɔ ngome yeɛ ɛte krongron ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Maen namukoraati kɔwa wɔ nyunu kɔɔsõ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ofikyɛ w'ahyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne ala ali.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ɛhe si ne, nwuni kyɛ babukye adanzeɛ <char style="w">tɛnt</char> né nekaa krongron ne wɔ anwuro, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />na abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtira ɔhaw nzoo ne fili nekaa krongron berɛ fitele, né bɛwura nwera fufue hyɛnn, na né bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ abɔsoɛ bapɛ bɛ nu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Na ateasefoɛ nna nanu kõ mane sɔ abɔfo nzoo ne sikaa kɔkorɛ kyɛnzee nzoo, né Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase daa ne yaa ne ayi ye dɛm. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Na Nyameɛ anuonyam ne ye tumi nati, nwosina yɛle nekaa krongron berɛ munguu, na ebiala angora anwura nekaa krongron berɛ oodwuli kyɛ abɔfo nzoo ne haw nzoo ne yiele ɔ.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Na ndele konviɛ kandinga bie mvili nekaa krongron berɛ, né ɔka kyire abɔfo nzoo ne kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔɔhwie bɔ ɔwɔ Nyameɛ ɛyaa kyɛnzee nzoo nanu ne bɛgua aseɛ so.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Bɔ oli moa ne hɔle, ná oohwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale aseɛ so. Na kena bɔ ɔyɛ yea na ɔyɛ suro tutuli bɛ bɔ bɛle kaka ne ahyɛnsodeɛ ná bɛsõ ye statu ne.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale ɛpo nu, na ɔyɛle ebie bɔ wawu mogya ne; na nikye biala bɔ ngoa wɔ nu, bɔ ɔwɔ ɛpo nanu ne wuli.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale nzue bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne nekaa bɔ nzue pukye fi ne, na bɛkakyile mogya. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Na ndele kyɛ abɔfo bɔ ɔnea nzue so ne ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“O Krongroniɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">wɔ bɔ né ɛwɔ berɛ, na ɛtɛ́ wɔ berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">atɛn bɔ abu ne kyire kyɛ ɛte teneneeniɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ofikyɛ bɛhwiele akrongronfoɛ ne adiifoɛ né mogya bɛguale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">na ama bɛ mogya kyɛ bɛno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">ɛhene ala yeɛ ɔfata bɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Na ndele kyɛ afɔleɛ bokyea né ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Awurade, Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">amba, w'atemmuo te nahorɛ na ɔtengyɛ.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nná ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale eyia naso, na bɛmane eyia ne atee kyɛ ɔfa see yerɛ-yera mmenia. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Na see bɔ yenoa yɛ hye paa yerɛ-yerale mmenia ne, ná Nyameɛ bɔ ole tumi wɔ ɔhaw nemɔ so ne, bɛkekane mmusue dwirɛ bɛfale ye dumaa nanwo, ná banzakra b'adwene bannhyɛ ye anuonyam.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Na bɔ ɔtɔ so nnu ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale kaka né bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> naso. Na ye ahennie né yɛle awosii kabii, na ɛyealɛ bɔ bɛtele nati, bɛpesale bɛ temverema. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Nakoso banzakra bamvi bɛ nneyɛɛ nanwo, mmom ɛyealɛ ne né bɛ nwo ngena-ngena nati, bɛ domene Nyameɛ bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu né guale Eufrate nzue pirikua nanu, na nzue bɔ ɔwɔ nu namukoraati wele, kyɛbɔ okosiesie atee kɔma ahemvo bɔ bɛfi eyia afiteleɛ dɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Na nwuni honhom nza bɔ bɛ nwo nde bie kyɛ bɛfi ɛwoo kandinga ne, kaka suronyi-suronyi ne, ɔne ngondombo adiifoɛ nemɔ noa nu bɛfite, né sɔ honhom nemɔ te kyɛ ɛporohyɛen. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛhemɔ te adaemone honhom bɔ bɛyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ, na bɛkɔ aseɛ so ahemvo mukoraati berɛ, bɛkɔboɔboa bɛ noa bɛma Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ kyẽa kandinga nanu koɛ ne. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Nea, meba te kyɛ awieniɛ. Anigye yeɛ ole ebiala bɔ ɔmaa ye nye da berɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ, “Osi pɛ” anaa “Ɔnna.”</char></note> na ɔnea ye atadeɛ so yé ne, ná wamva ye nwo wando so wannate ma bannwu ye nwo.” <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Na bɛboɔboale bɛ noa wɔ nekaa bie, Hebri nu ne, bɛfrɛ berɛ Amagedon.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Na bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo ne hwiele bɔ ɔwɔ ye kyɛnzee nanu ne guale mvrama nu. Na konviɛ kandinga bie fili bia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia; okyire bia bɔ ɔhene tena so ne.”</char></note> bɔ ogyi asɔre awuro berɛ nanu wale kyɛ: “Wayie!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Na agralaa tetele yerɛm-yerɛm, agralaa bobɔle nu, na aseɛ wosolɛ kandinga bie sili, sɔ aseɛ wosolɛ ne, ofi mmerɛ bɔ sona wale aseɛ naso ne, ebie silli lle; né aseɛ wosolɛ ne noa yɛ se paa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Kuro piri nanu hyɛle nza, na maen nemɔ nguro nemɔ sɛkyele; na Nyameɛ kayele Babilon Kandinga ne,<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Bɛkayele Babilon Kandinga ne wɔ Nyameɛ Nyunu.”</char></note> kyɛ ɔ́fa kwangoa bɔ ye yaa bɔ yenoa yɛ hye nzãa wɔ nu né ma ye. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Supɔ biala nwatili, na bannwu bokaa biala kõ. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Afei asukɔtwea mbiri-mbiri bɔ kõ biala nu nnunɛ kɔyɛ kilo 20<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Talɛnde kõ.”</char></note> tɔ fili anwuro guale mmenia naso, na ɔhaw bɔ asukɔtwea ne maa ɔwale mmenia naso nati, bɛkekane mmusue dwirɛ bɛfale Nyameɛ nwo, ofikyɛ né ɔhaw ne noa yɛ hye paa.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Na abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtira kyɛnzee nzoo nanu kõ ha hyirele me kyɛ: “Bra, na ngohyire wɔ tuutuuniɛ kandinga bɔ ɔte nzue pee so né atemmuo. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Ye yeɛ aseɛ so ahemvo ne ye abɔ adwaman, ná ye adwamammɔ nzãa ne amaa aseɛ sofoɛ mukoraati abobo ne.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Na ɔnate honhom naso fale me hɔle ɛserɛ so, na nwuni kyɛ brasua bie te kaka suronyi-suronyi kɔkorɛ bie so. Né mmusue dumaa wɔ kaka nanwo mukoraati, na né ole tire nzoo ne mmɛen buru. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Né brasua ne wura atadeɛ <char style="tl">valent <note caller="°" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo “Purple.”</char></note></char> ne atadeɛ kɔkorɛ, na né wafa sikaa kɔkorɛ ne agudeɛ pa wasiesie ye nwo. Né otira sikaa kɔkorɛ kwangoa wɔ ye sa nu, na né akyiwadeɛ ne ye adwamammɔ tɛɛ-tɛɛ ne ayi ye dɛm. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Né bahworɔ dumaa bie bagua ye nwoma so, ɔte edwirɛ bɔ wafea, yeɛ ole:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">Babilon Kandinga,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">Tuutuufoɛ ne aseɛ so abusudeɛ mukoraati maame.<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Na nwuni kyɛ akrongronfoɛ ne Yesu nwo adanzefoɛ né mogya amaa brasua ne abo. Nwuni ye sɔ ne, me nwo dwirili me pa-pa. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Yeɛ abɔfo ne bisale me kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ wɔ nwo adwiri wɔ sɔ ne? Ngɔha brasua ne, ɔne kaka bɔ ɔte ye so, bɔ yeti nzoo na ye mmɛen buru nanwo dwirɛ bɔ wafea ngohyire wɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Kaka bɔ ɛnwuni ye ne, né ɔwɔ berɛ, nakoso kesaalae de ɔnne berɛ, ná okofi kumaa kuron-kuron nanu kofite, na bɛkɔsɛkye ye. Na sɛ aseɛ nasofoɛ bɔ ofi wiase ahyɛaseɛ, bɛ dumaa nne ngoa nwomaa nanu ne nwu kyɛbɔ né kaka ne wɔ berɛ, na afei ɔnne berɛ, na okosa kɔwa ne a, ɔkɔyɛ bɛ nwanwa paa.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Ɛwa yeɛ nyanza nwo hia paa ne: Tire nzoo ne gyi berɛ ma mmokaa nzoo bɔ brasua ne te so ɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Na bɛte ahemvo nzoo: Nnu afi ase, kõ wɔ berɛ, bɔ waha ne de, ɔwalle; nakoso ɔba a, odikyɛ ɔtena berɛ kaa. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Kaka suronyi-suronyi bɔ ne ɔwɔ berɛ, nakoso kesaalae de ɔnne berɛ ne, ye ala yeɛ ole ɔhene bɔ ɔtɔ so mmɔtwɛ ne, ofi nzoo nanu yeɛ ɔwale ɔ, ná bɛkɔsɛkye ye. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Mmɛen buru bɔ ɛnwuni ye ne kyire ahemvo nzoo bɔ kesaalae de benyanne tumi, nakoso bɛne kaka ne konya tumi kyɛ ahemvo dɔnhwere kõ. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Ɛhemɔ le adwene kõ, yeti bɛkɔfa b'anwoserɛ ne bɛ tumi bɛkɔma kaka ne. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ɛhemɔ ne Boan Ba ne kɔhõ, nakoso ɔnate kyɛ Boan Ba ne te awura mɔ nu Awurade ne ahemvo nu Hene nati, okoli bɛ so ngunim. Na bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so bɔ bafrɛ bɛ, baye bɛ, ná bɛdi nahorɛ ne koso koli ngunim.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Nzue pee bɔ ɛnwuni ye, nekaa bɔ tuutuuniɛ ne te ne, ɔte mmenia, mmeni lɔen, maen-maen ne dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Na mmɛen buru bɔ ɛnwuni ye ne, ɔne kaka suronyi-suronyi ne, bɛkɔtane tuutuuniɛ ne, bɛkole ye nwo nningyein mukoraati maa ye nwo kɔla so, bɛkoli ye naen, ná bafa see bayera ye. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔfa wurale b'ahone nu kyɛ bɛma ye tianu adwene bra nu, ná bɛyɛ kõ bɛfa b'ahennie bɛma kaka ne kodwu kyɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ kɔwa nu ɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Na brasua bɔ ɛnwuni ye ne, yeɛ ole kuro kandinga bɔ odi aseɛ so ahemvo mukoraati so ne.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, nwuni kyɛ abɔfo foforɛ dwu fi anwuro. Né ole tumi paa, na ye anuonyam nati aseɛ naso mukoraati tale hyireinn. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Na ɔfale konviɛ pirikua teane nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Wafi ase oo! Babilon Kandinga ne afi ase!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Na wayɛ sunzummɔne mɔ awuro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ne nekaa bɔ honhom bɔ bɛ nwo nde, nnomaa bɔ bɛ nwo nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">ɔne nnomaa bɔ bekyi kɔtetɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ná ɔnate ye adwamammɔ akɔnnɔ nanwo nzãa naso anya maen-maen namukoraati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">na aseɛ naso ahemvo ne ye abɔ adwaman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">ná ye ahonyadeɛ bɔ waboa ye noa wagua berɛ ne amaa aseɛ so adwadifoɛ anya bɛ nwo.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Na ndele konviɛ foforɛ mvili anwuro kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Me maen,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia.”</char></note> ɛmɔfi ye nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ná ɛmɔ anyɛ ye bɔne ne bie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ná ɛmɔ annya ye haw ne bie.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Ofikyɛ ye bɔne ne aboaboa ye noa waadwu anwuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">ná Nyameɛ akaye ye amumuyɛɛ ne.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Bɔ ɔfa yɛle mmenia ne, ɛmɔyɛ ye bie betua ye kerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">bɔ ɔyɛle ne, ɛmɔbɔ ye nwo nyɔ bɛma ye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">kwangoa bɔ ɔfrale ye nzãa wɔ nu ne, ɛmɔfra ye mmɔho nyɔ wɔ nu bɛma ye.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Kyɛbɔ ɔhyɛle ye nwo anuonyam, na ɔgyele ye nye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ye ayayade na ɛmɔma oli aworaborɛ ɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">ofikyɛ né ɔka ye wɔ y'ahone nu kyɛ: ‘Nde berɛ kyɛ ɔhemaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">nnde kunaniɛ, na mengonwu aworaborɛ lle.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ ye haw kɔwa ɛlɛhomapɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ewue, aworaborɛ ne ɛhɔen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">na bɛkɔfa see bɛkɔyera ye dwerebɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">Ofikyɛ Awurade, Nyameɛ bɔ obuli ye atɛn ne, ye nwo yɛ se.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Sɛ́ bɛyera ye, ná aseɛ naso ahemvo bɔ bɛne ye bɔle adwaman, na bɛne ye gyele bɛ nye ne nwu ye nwosina bɔ ɔfo kɔ anwuro ne a, bɛkosu ye na babɔ awuye. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Na ɔnate kyɛ bɛsuro ayayade bɔ bɛyɛ ye nati bɛkogyina dede, na baha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Yaakɔ oo! Yaakɔ! kuro kandinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Babilon, kuro bɔ wɔ nwo yɛ se!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Dɔnhwere komapɛ nu yeɛ w'atemmuo awa ne.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />“Na aseɛ naso adwadifoɛ nemɔ koso kosu, na bali ye nwo aworaborɛ, ofikyɛ ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔtɔ bɛ nningyein nemɔ kõ; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />sikaa kɔkorɛ, dwetɛ, nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se, agudeɛ, nwera pa, ɛtena <char style="tl">valent</char>, ɛtena pa, koogyan,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛtena kɔkorɛ.”</char></note> nikye biala bɔ bafa bakaa bɔ ɔbo fona bayɛ, ɔne nikye biala bɔ bafa ɛsoen gye, bakaa pa, kɔɔbere, buralɛ ɔne nyɔboɛ pa bayɛ; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />afei sinamon, spises, insɛns, ngoo fona-fona, ɛyɛɛ, nzãa, anwa, esam pa, hwiit, nandwie ne mmoan, mbɔngɔ ne teaseɛnam, ngoaa, ne mmenia ngoa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia kra.”</char></note> <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Na bɛkɔha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">‘Aduaba bɔ wɔ konvi wɔ so ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">wafi wɔ nwo wahɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:14">w'aleɛ sɔkyee ne nningyein bɔ ole anuonyam namukoraati anwati ahɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:14">na ɛngonwu bɛ kõ.’<verse eid="REV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />“Na adwadifoɛ bɔ bɛtɔne nningyein hemɔ, bɔ ɔnate ye so maa banya bɛ nwo ne kogyina dede, na ɔnate kyɛ bɛsuro ayayade bɔ bɛyɛ ye nati, bɛkosu na bali aworaborɛ, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />ná bɛkɔha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">‘Yaakɔ oo! Yaakɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">kuro kandinga bɔ afa nwera pa, ɛtena <char style="tl">valent</char> ne ɛtena kɔkorɛ ahra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">ná afa sikaa kɔkorɛ, nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se, ne agudeɛ asiesie wɔ nwo!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ofikyɛ dɔnhwere komapɛ yeɛ basɛkye ɛhe amukoraati ne.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17">Na bɛ bɔ bɛtwi hyep, bɛ bɔ bɛfa hyep bɛtu atee, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma wɔ hyep nu, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma wɔ ɛpo so namukoraati kogyina dede, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />na sɛ bɛnwu nwosina bɔ ofi see bɔ bɛfa bɛyera ye nanu a, bɛkɔha kyɛ: ‘Kuro beni yeɛ ɔte kyɛ kuro kandinga he ɔ?’<verse eid="REV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Bɛkɔfa mvuture bɛkogua bɛ ti so, na basu bali aworaborɛ baha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">‘Yaakɔ oo! Yaakɔ! kuro kandinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">kuro bɔ bɛ bɔ bɛle hyep mukoraati nate ye ahonyadeɛ so anya bɛ nwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Ofikyɛ dɔnhwere komapɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">yeɛ basɛkye ye koraa ne.’<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />‘O anwuro, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">na akrongronfoɛ, asomafoɛ ne adiifoɛ ne koso</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ofikyɛ Nyameɛ abu ye atɛn ama ɛmɔ!’ ”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Na abɔfo bie bɔ ole anwoserɛ paa fale nyɔboɛ kandinga bie, né ɔte kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛtĩ hwiit ne, ná ogyi tole ɛpo nanu hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Sɔ ala yeɛ bɛkogyi Babilon kandinga ne bɛkɔto ɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ná bɛngonwu ye kõ.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Na bɛngɔte bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ dwotai, bɛ bɔ bɛto dwein,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">bɛ bɔ bɛhu atɛntɛnbɛn, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛhu awɛen nga wɔ wɔ nu kõ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Na sɔ ala yeɛ bɛngonwu ebiala bɔ ole ye sa noa adwuma wɔ wɔ nu kõ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">na bɛngɔte nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛtĩ nikye nga wɔ wɔ nu kõ.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Na kanea biala ngɔta wɔ wɔ nu kõ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">na bɛngɔte ayeforɔ ne brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya nga wɔ wɔ nu kõ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Ofikyɛ w'adwadifoɛ yeɛ ne bɛdi mu paa wɔ aseɛ naso ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">na ɛfale w'ahonhomzɛm naso laka-lakale maen-maen namukoraati.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />“Ye nu yeɛ bɛnwuni adiifoɛ, akrongronfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛhuni bɛ wɔ aseɛ so namukoraati ne mogya ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, ndele konviɛ bie, né wayɛ kyɛ ɛlɔen kandinga bie konvi. Na bɛteane nu kyɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluya!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haleluya te Hebri dwirɛ bɔ yebo kyire “Ɛmɔye </char><char style="bdit">Yah</char>(Awurade) ayɛ.”</note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Yɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ odɛ́ ngoa, na ye yeɛ anuonyam ne tumi te ye deɛ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ofikyɛ ye atemmuo te nahorɛ, na ɔtengyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Wabu tuutuuniɛ kandinga bɔ wafa ye adwamammɔ wagua aseɛ nanwo fiɛ ne atɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">ná ye ngoaa nemɔ mogya bɔ ɔwɔ ye sa nwo ne, watua so kerɛ.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Na besa bɛteane nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Ye nwosina ne tu kɔ anwuro daa, daa.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Na mbanyi 24 ne né ateasefoɛ nna ne fale bɛ nyunu butuli berɛ, na bɛsõne Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne, na bɛhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen! Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Na konviɛ bie fili ɔhene bia nanu wale kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Ɛmɔye yɛ Nyameɛ ayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ye ngoaa bɔ ɛmɔsuro ye namukoraati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">atitire ne mmaa-mmaa.”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Na ndele konviɛ bie te kyɛ ɛlɔen kandinga bie konvi, né konviɛ ne te kyɛ nzue pee bɔ obu fa so ne agralaa bɔ ɔbobɔ nu ne. Na bɛhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Ofikyɛ Awurade, yɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte Otumvoɛ ne, wahyɛ yebo odi tumi.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ɛmɔma yɛ nye gye na yɛli ahurusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ná yɛhyɛ ye anuonyam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">ofikyɛ Boan Ba né ayeforɔ ne adwu so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">na ɔye ne asiesie ye nwo.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Bama ye atee kyɛ ɔhra nwera pa bɔ ye nye te kama.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">Nwera pa ne gyi berɛ ma akrongronfoɛ ne nneyɛɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne.”<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ, “Tworɔ ɛhe: Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bato bɛ sa bafrɛ bɛ kyɛ bɛbra Boan Ba n'ayeforɔ né paati nabo ne.” Osa ha hyirele me kyɛ: “Ɛhe te nahorɛ dwirɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Yeti, mvale me nyunu mmutuli berɛ kyɛ mesõ ye, nakoso ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Nea yé! Nnɛyɛ sɔ! Me koso nde akoaa te kyɛ wɔ ne eliema mɔ bɔ bɛtira Yesu nwo adanzeɛ adwuma nanu ne. Sõ Nyameɛ! Ofikyɛ Yesu nwo adanzeɛ yeɛ ɔmaa bɛhyɛ ngɔm ɔ.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Na nwuni kyɛ anwuro abukye, mekwaanea a, pɔngɔ fufue bue ɛhe. Na bɔ ɔte so ne, bɛfrɛ ye Ebie bɔ ɔka Nahorɛ ná Bɛle ye nu Gyidie; na tenenee nu yeɛ obu atɛn na ɔkɔ koɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ye nye mmaa te kyɛ see bɔ ɔsɔ ne, na ahennie abotire pee bobɔ ye ti anwo. Bahworɔ dumaa bie bagua ye nwo, bɔ ebiala nze, sana ye bɔbɔ, <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />na atadeɛ bɔ owura ye ne, mogya abɔ apete nu. Na bɛfrɛ ye Nyameɛ Dwirɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Afei, sogyafoɛ lɔen bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne tete mbɔngɔ so li ye si, na bɛwura nwera pa, nwera fufue bɔ ye nye te. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Na dadeɛ tendee naen-naen bie fili ye noa nu fitele, ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔbobɔ maen-maen ne; na ɔkɔfa buralɛ pɔmaa koli bɛ so. Afei koso, ye yeɛ otietia Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ ɛyaa kumaa bɔ bɛtwi nzãa wɔ nu naso ɔ. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Na bahworɔ dumaa bie wɔ ye atadeɛ nanu ne ye sɔ nanwo kyɛ, Ahemvo nu Hene ne awura mɔ nu Awurade.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Nza nwuni abɔfo bie bɔ ogyi eyia nu, na ɔteane nu frɛle nnomaa bɔ batu nate ewienu namukoraati kyɛ: “Ɛmɔbra, ɛmɔɔyia Nyameɛ paati pirikua nabo, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />na ɛmɔli ahemvo mɔ naen, asahene mɔ naen, mmrienzua bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ se naen, mbɔngɔ ne bɛ bɔ bɛtete bɛ so ne naen, ɔne ebiala naen, bɛ bɔ balɛ́ bɛ nwo, ne ngoaa, mmaa-mmaa ne atitire.” <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Na nwuni kyɛ kaka suronyi-suronyi ne né aseɛ naso ahemvo ne bɛ sogyafoɛ aboa bɛ noa kyɛ, bɛne bɔ ɔte pɔngɔ naso ne né ye sogyafoɛ nemɔ kwaahõ. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Na bɛhyele kaka ne, na bɛhyele ngondombo diifoɛ bɔ ɔyɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ wɔ ye nyunu fa laka-lakale bɛ bɔ bɛlɛle kaka né ahyɛnsodeɛ ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛsõne ye statu ne bɛ bokale ye so. Na bɛgyili bɛ munyɔ anikaen bɛguale see bɔ sɔfa wɔ nu nanu. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Na bɛ ngaa ne de, dadeɛ tendee bɔ ofi bɔ ɔte pɔngɔ naso né noa nu wale ne, ɛhene yeɛ bɛfa bɛhuni bɛ ɔ. Na nnomaa namukoraati lili bɛ naen maa bɛ ko yili.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Afei nwuni abɔfo bie kyɛ ofi anwuro odwu ba ase, né otira kumaa kuron-kuron né nzafoa ne kyenyi kandinga bie wɔ ye sa nu. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Na ɔhyele ɛwoo suronyi-suronyi ne, sɔ daa tete ɛwoo, bɔ yeɛ ole Abɔnzam ne Satan ne, na ɔkyekyele ye afoɛ 1,000. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Na ogyili ye tole kumaa nanu, na ɔtole nu fale nikye tale ye noa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔngɔlaka-laka maen-maen ne kõ, kodwu kyɛ afoɛ 1,000 ne kɔwa awieɛ ɔ. Ɛhe si ne, odikyɛ bɛyakyi ye kaa.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Afei nwuni ɔhene bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> biemɔ, na bɛmane bɛ bɔ bɛtete so nemɔ tumi kyɛ bɛbu atɛn. Na nwuni bɛ bɔ ɔnate Yesu nwo adanzeɛ ne Nyameɛ dwirɛ nati bɛpepɛle bɛ ti nemɔ kra, ɔne bɛ bɔ bannzo kaka ne anaa ye statu ne, ná banne ahyɛnsodeɛ ne bie wɔ bɛ nwoma so anaa bɛ sa nwo ne. Bɛwale ngoa nu bieku, na bɛne Kristo lili hene afoɛ 1,000. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Nakoso awufo ngaa nemɔ de, bamma ngoa nu tonn maa afoɛ 1,000 ne wale awieɛ. Ɛhe yeɛ ole ewue tingyele bɔ oli moa ne. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ebiala bɔ onyane ewue tingyelɛ bɔ oli moa ne bie ne, ole anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> na ɔte krongron; ofikyɛ ewue bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne, olle bɛ so tumi. Mmom bɛkɔyɛ asɔfo bɛkɔma Nyameɛ ne Kristo, na bɛne ye koli hene afoɛ 1,000.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Afoɛ 1,000 ne so ala pɛ, bɛkɔye Satan bɛkofi prizin, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />na okofite kɔɔlaka-laka maen-maen bɔ bɛwɔ aseɛ naso namukoraati, Gog ne Magog, ná waboɔboa bɛ noa wama koɛ ne. Ɛhemɔ dodoɔ te kyɛ ɛpo noa anweaa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Bɛhɔle aseɛ naso nekaa biala, na bɛpɛle nekaa bɔ akrongronfoɛ nemɔ te ne kuro bɔ bɛdɔ ye nanwo beyiale. Nakoso see fili anwuro ɔɔyerale bɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na Abɔnzam bɔ ɔlaka-lakale bɛ ne, bɛgyili ye bɛtole see bɔ sɔfa wɔ nu nanu, nekaa bɔ ne kaka ne né ngondombo diifoɛ ne wɔ ne, na bɛkɔyɛ bɛ ayayade daa, eyia ne kɔngɔen.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Na nwuni ɔhene bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> fufue pirikua bie ne bɔ ɔte so ne. Na aseɛ ne anwuro nwati fili ye nyunu, na bannya nekaa bamma bɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Na nwuni awufo, mmaa-mmaa ne atitire kyɛ bɛgyigyi ɔhene bia ne nyunu. Na bɛbukyele nwomaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Nwomaa bɔ babobɔ.”</char></note> biemɔ nu, besa bɛbukyele nwomaa foforɛ nu, ɛhene yeɛ ole ngoa nwomaa ne. Na bɛgyinane edwirɛ bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ nwomaa nemɔ nu naso bebule awufo nemɔ atɛn, kyɛbɔ bɛ nneyɛɛ te ɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Na ɛpo yele awufo bɔ bɛwɔ nu ne wale, ná ewue ne Asieleɛ yele awufo bɔ bɛwɔ bɛ nu nemɔ wale, na bɛbule bɛ nu biala atɛn, kyɛbɔ ye nneyɛɛ te ɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Na bɛgyili ewue ne Asieleɛ bɛguale see nanu. See ne yeɛ ole ewue bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Afei koso, ebiala bɔ bannwu ye dumaa wɔ ngoa nwomaa nanu ne, bɛgyili ye bɛtole see nanu.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Na nwuni anwuro foforɛ ne aseɛ foforɛ; né anwuro daa ne aseɛ daa ne apɛ nu, na ɛpo nne berɛ kõ. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Na nwuni kuro krongron ne, Yerusalem foforɛ ne kyɛ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ wɔ anwuro odwu ba ase, na né basiesie ye kyɛ ayeforɔ bɔ bɛfa ye bɛkɔma ohu ne. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Na ndele konviɛ kandinga bie mvili ɔhene bia nanu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:3">“Nea, Nyameɛ <char style="w">tɛnt</char> wɔ mmenia nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:3">na ɔne bɛ kɔtena, ná bayɛ ye maen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:3">Na Nyameɛ bɔbɔ ne bɛ kɔtena.<verse eid="REV 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Na okokyikyi bɛ nye abo moen mukoraati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:4">Na ewue nne berɛ kõ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 21:4">na aworaborɛ ne esuɛ ne yealɛ biala nne berɛ kõ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 21:4">ofikyɛ daa nningyein nemɔ apɛ nu.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Na bɔ ɔte ɔhene bia naso ne hane kyɛ: “Nea, meyɛ nningyein mukoraati foforɛ.” Osa hane kyɛ: “Tworɔ, ofikyɛ edwirɛ hemɔ te nahorɛ, na ɔkɔwa nu.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Wawa nu! Me yeɛ nne Alfa ne Omega, ahyɛaseɛ ne awieɛ ne. Ebiala bɔ nzuhɔen ku ye ne, ngɔma ye ngoa nzue ti nanu nzue ne bie mbaen. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ebiala bɔ odi ngunim ne, okonya ɛhe amukoraati, na ngɔyɛ ye Nyameɛ, ná ye koso wayɛ mma. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛte serɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛlle gyidie, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ tɛ, awudifoɛ, adwamammɔfoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ahonhomzɛm, bɛ bɔ bɛsõ bosoen, ne ngondombofoɛ mukoraati de, bekonya bɛ kyɛfa wɔ see ne sɔfa nanu. Ɛhe yeɛ ole ewue bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Na abɔfo nzoo bɔ bɛtire-tira kyɛnzee nzoo bɔ ɔhaw bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne wɔ nu nanu kõ wale me berɛ, na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Bra, na ngohyire wɔ ayeforɔ ne, Boan Ba ne aye ne.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Na ɔnate honhom naso fale me hɔle bokaa kandinga tendee bie so, na ohyirele me Yerusalem kuro krongron ne kyɛ odwu fi Nyameɛ berɛ wɔ anwuro ba ase, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />na ne ole Nyameɛ anuonyam. Na ɔta hyireinn te kyɛ nyɔboɛ pa paa, te kyɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">jasper</char> ne, hyireinn kyɛ ahwehwɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ole fasue pirikua tendee, na ole anoa 12 bɔ abɔfo 12 gyigyi ye nwo, na ne bahworɔ Israel mmaa mmusuakue 12 ne dumaa bagua anoa nemɔ nwo. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Né anoa nanu nza wɔ afiteleɛ, nza wɔ sorɔ, nza wɔ ngwaen, yeɛ nza wɔ atɔleɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Né sua ne fasue ne koso le fapem 12, na ne bahworɔ Boan Ba né asomafoɛ 12 ne dumaa bagua bɛ nwo.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Né abɔfo bɔ ɔne me dwudwo ne tira elemmire bɔ bafa sikaa kɔkorɛ bayɛ, na né ɔbaafa susu kuro ne, ye anoa ne, ɔne ye fasue ne. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ne kuro ne te ahinanan,<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: 4 square.</char></note> ye tendee ne ye piri te pɛ. Na ɔfale elemmire ne susuli kuro ne, né ɔte kilomita 2,220;<note caller="▪" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɔ okyire deinn: “</char><char style="it">Stadium</char> 12,000.”</note> ye tendee, ye piri, ne ye tɛtrɛtɛ ne te pɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Osa susuli ye fasue ne, né ɔte mita 64, osusuli ye kyɛbɔ sona susu nikye, na sɔ ala yeɛ abɔfo koso susu ye ɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" /><char style="tl">Jasper</char> yeɛ ne bafa bayɛ fasue ne ɔ, na kuro ne koso, ne ɔte sikaa kɔkorɛ pa paa, bɔ ye nye te kyɛ ahwehwɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Kuro ne fapem bɔ fasue ne gyi so ne, bɛfale nyɔboɛ pa mukoraati bie yeɛ bɛhyehyɛle ɔ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:19">Bɔ oli moa ne te <char style="it">jasper</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:19">bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne te <char style="it">safire</char>,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Sapphire.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:19">bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne te <char style="it">kasedoni</char>,<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Chalcedony.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:19">bɔ ɔtɔ so nná ne te <char style="it">emerald</char>,<verse eid="REV 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />nnu ne te <char style="it">sardons</char>,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Sardonyx.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">nzia ne te <char style="it">kanelian</char>,<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Carnelian.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">nzoo ne te <char style="it">krisolite</char>,<note caller="◦" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Chrysolite.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">mmɔtwɛ ne te <char style="it">beril</char>,<note caller="▫" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Beryl.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">ngona ne te <char style="it">topaz</char>,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">buru ne te <char style="it">krisoprase</char>,<note caller="▪" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Chrysoprase.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">buru-ne-kõ ne te <char style="it">hasin</char>,<note caller="⁺" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Hyacinth anaa Jacinth.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 21:20">yeɛ buru-ne-nyɔ ne te <char style="it">amatɛs</char>.<note caller="●" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: “Amethyst.”</char></note><verse eid="REV 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Afei koso, agudeɛ pa 12 yeɛ ne bafa bayɛ anoa 12 ne ɔ. Ná kuro né dwaaso ne te sikaa kɔkorɛ pa bɔ ye nye la berɛ te kyɛ ahwehwɛ.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Mannwu asɔre awuro biala wɔ nu, ofikyɛ Awurade, Otumvoɛ Nyameɛ ne né Boan Ba ne yeɛ bɛte ye asɔre awuro ɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Na onhia kyɛ eyia anaa ɛsraen ta kuro nanu, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam ta kuro nanu, na Boan Ba ne yeɛ ɔte ye kanea ɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Maen-maen ne kɔnate ye kanea nanu, na aseɛ so ahemvo kɔfa b'anuonyam kɔwa nu. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Na kuro ne anoa ne kɔla so daa bɔ bɛngɔto nu ɔ, ofikyɛ aleɛ ngɔsa berɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Na bɛkɔfa maen-maen n'anuonyam ne nidie bɛkɔwa nu. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Nakoso nikye biala bɔ ye nwo nde, ɔne ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ akyiwadeɛ anaa ɔlaka-laka mmenia ne, ɔngɔhɔ kuro nanu lle. Bɛ bɔ bahworɔ bɛ dumaa wɔ Boan Ba ne ngoa nwomaa nanu ne ngome yeɛ bɛkɔhɔ nu ɔ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Afei ohyirele me ngoa nzue bɔ ɔtengyɛ, bɔ ye nye te hyɛnn kyɛ ahwehwɛ, né ɔtengyɛ fi Nyameɛ ne Boan Ba né bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Ɔhene bia.”</char></note> nanu, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />na ɔbafa atee kandinga bɔ ɔla kuro nanu né afia. Na ngoa mmakaa gyigyi nzue ne bɛen ne ye famaa, bɔ osu mmaa buru-ne-nyɔ afoɛ biala, osu mmaa bosome biala. Na ye nyaa yeɛ bɛfa bɛsa mmenia ne anwonyerɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Mmusue biala ngɔwa berɛ kõ. Mmom Nyameɛ ne Boan Ba ne bia ne yeɛ ɔwɔ kuro nanu ɔ, na ye ngoaa kɔsõ ye. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Bɛkonwu ye nyunu, na ye dumaa kogua bɛ nwoma so. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Aleɛ ngɔsa berɛ kõ, na bengohia kanea anaa eyia, ofikyɛ Awurade Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ bɛ kanea ɔ, na bɛkoli hene daa daa.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ te nahorɛ, na ɔkɔwa nu. Awurade, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔnate adiifoɛ so dwudwo ne, wasoma ye abɔfo kyɛ ɔma ye ngoaa nwu nningyein bɔ ɔngɔhyɛ okosisi ne.” <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Nea, meba ndɛ-ndɛ. Ebiala bɔ odi ngɔmhyɛ dwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ nwomaa he anu naso ne, ole anigye.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note><verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Me Yohane, me yeɛ ndele ɛhemɔ na nwuni ye ne, na mmerɛ bɔ ndele na nwuni ye ne, mmutuli abɔfo bɔ ohyirele me sɔ nningyein nemɔ ne gya bo kyɛ mesõ ye. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “Nea yé! Nnɛyɛ sɔ! Me koso nde akoaa te kyɛ wɔ ne eliema adiifoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛdi edwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ nwomaa he anu naso nala. Sõ Nyameɛ.”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Osa ha hyirele me kyɛ: “Ngɔmhyɛ dwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ sɔ nwomaa he anu ne, nnɛfa nikye ta ye noa, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bahyɛ ne aso ayie. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Bɔ ɔndengyɛ ne, ɔhɔ so yɛ nningyein bɔ ɔndengyɛ, yeɛ bɔ ye nwo nde ne, ɔhɔ so yɛ nningyein bɔ ye nwo nde; nakoso teneneeniɛ de, ɔhɔ so yɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ, na bɔ ɔte krongron ne hɔ so yɛ nningyein bɔ ɔte krongron.<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Nea, meba ndɛ-ndɛ, na ndira m'akatua kyɛ mefa mebrɛ ebiala kyɛbɔ ye adwuma te ɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Me yeɛ nne Alfa ne Omega, bɔ oli moa ne bɔ ɔpɛ yebo, ahyɛaseɛ ne awieɛ ne.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />“Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛpo bɛ ndadeɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonya atee bɛkɔhɔ ngoa mmakaa nanwo, na banya atee bafa anoa nemɔ nu bahɔ kuro nanu ne. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Kuro ne si yeɛ ngyea, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ahonhomzɛm, adwamammɔfoɛ, awudifoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛsõ bosoen, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛkuro ngondombo na bɛpɛ ngondombo ne gua ɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Me Yesu, me yeɛ nzomane m'abɔfo kyɛ ooli sɔ nningyein hemɔ nwo adanzeɛ hyire ɛmɔ ma asafo nemɔ. Me yeɛ nde David ndii ne ye bosoniɛ ne, ná nde ngyerɛmɔ nzramaa bɔ ɔta ne.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Na honhom ne né ayeforɔ ne ka kyɛ: “Bra!” Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔte ne, ma ɔha kyɛ “Bra!” Na ebiala bɔ nzuhɔen ku ye ne, ma ɔbra, ná ebiala bɔ okuro ne, ma oole ngoa nzue mbaen.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />“Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔte ngɔmhyɛ dwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ nwomaa he anu ne, mebɔ ye kɔkɔ kyɛ: Sɛ ebie fa edwirɛ bie boka so a, Nyameɛ kɔfa ɔhaw bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ nwomaa he anu ne kɔboka ye so; <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />na sɛ ebie ye edwirɛ bie fi ngɔmhyɛ nwomaa he anu a, Nyameɛ kɔye ye kyɛfa deɛ kofi ngoa bakaa ne kuro krongron bɔ bahworɔ ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ nwomaa he anu nanu.”<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Bɔ odi ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ ne nwa: “Amba, meba ndɛ-ndɛ.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 22:20">“Amen. Awurade Yesu bra!”<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Awurade Yesu adom ha akrongronfoɛ namukoraati.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>